PVD("china_ndp_2011-2015",{"docs":["","CN NDP 2011 15"],"s":{"1":[[1,"3","2","Manufacturing Competitiveness and Industrial Upgrading","We sill elevate the core competitiveness of manufacturing industry, improving the new and strategic industries, speeding up the development of service industry as well as the primary and the second industries",""],[1,"6","1","Modern Industrial System Development","Adhere to the new path of industrialization with Chinese characteristics, adapt to changes of market needs, give play to the comparative advantage of our country's industries in the global economy in light of the new trend of scientific and technological progress, and develop a modern industry system featuring optimized structure, advanced technology, cleanliness and safety, high added value and large employment capacity.",""],[1,"6","2","Manufacturing Industry Upgrading and Structural Optimization","Optimize structure, improve varieties and quality, enhance industry supporting capability, eliminate backward production capacity, develop the advanced equipment manufacturing industry, adjust the optimize raw material industries, transform and improve the consumer goods industry, and promoting the enlargement and enhancement of manufacturing industries.",""]],"2":[[1,"9","5","Strategic Emerging Industries Development Initiative","Promote the deep fusion of rising technologies and industries based on major technological breakthroughs and development needs, and develop new strategic industries into leading and pillar industries while continuing to strengthen and enlarge high-tech industries.",""],[1,"9","7","Development of Strategic Emerging Industries","Develop new strategic industries energetically, such as energy-saving and environment-friendly new-generation IT, biology, high-end equipment manufacturing, new energy sources, new materials and new energy automobile.",""],[1,"9","7","Energy Conservation and Environmental Protection Technology Development","In the energy conservation and environmental protection industry, focus on the development of key technological equipment for efficient energy conservation, advanced environmental protection and resource recycling, products and services.",""],[1,"9","7","Next-Generation Information Technology Industry Development","In the new-generation IT industry, focus on the development of new-generation mobile communication, new- generation Internet, three-network convergence, Internet of things, cloud computing, IC, new displays, high-end software, high-end servers and information services.",""],[1,"9","7","Biological Industry Development Programme","In the biological industry, focus on the development of biopharmaceuticals, biomedical engineering products, bio-agriculture and bio-manufacturing.",""],[1,"9","7","New Energy Industry Development","In the new energy industry, focus on the development of new-generation nuclear energy and solar energy utilization, photovoltaic and photo-thermal power generation, and wind power technological equipment, intelligent power grids and biomass energy.",""],[1,"9","7","New Materials Industry Development","In the new material industry, focus on the development of new functional materials, advanced structural materials, high-performance fibers and compound materials, and common basic materials.",""],[1,"11","4","Special Funds for Strategic Industry Development","Set up special funds for the development of new strategic industries and industry investment, expand the size of governmental startup investment in rising industries, give play to the financing function of capital markets at different levels, and guide social capital to be invested in innovative startups.",""],[1,"11","4","Innovation Finance Incentives and Credit Support","Make comprehensive use of financial preferential policies, such as risk compensation, and encourage financial institutions to strengthen credit support.",""],[1,"11","4","Industrial Standards and Technical Standards Development","Accelerate the establishment of industrial standards in favor of the development of new strategic industries and important technical standards for products.",""],[1,"11","4","Infrastructure Support for New Products and Applications","Support the construction of infrastructure that supports new products and applications, and create a favorable environment for the fostering and development of market demand.",""]],"3":[[1,"51","12","State-Owned Enterprise Reform","Deepen the reform of state owned enterprises",""],[1,"51","13","Strategic State Capital Allocation to Priority Industries","Channel state capital into industries pertinent to national security and economy through discretionary and rational capital injection or withdrawal.",""],[1,"51","13","Large SOE Listing Reform","Overall listing shall be achieved for large SOEs that get the requisite qualifications.",""],[1,"51","13","Mixed-Ownership Reform for Large SOEs","Large SOEs that are not able to be listed shall put forward the reform of diversity of equities.",""],[1,"51","13","Corporate System Reform for State-Owned Enterprises","Large SOEs that shall remain solely funded by the State shall carry out corporate system reform.",""],[1,"51","13","Salt and Railway Industry Reform","Put forward the reform in the salt and railway industries.",""],[1,"51","16","State-Owned Assets Governance Separation","Uphold the separation of the functions of government as public administrator and state-owned assets investors.",""],[1,"51","16","State-Owned Asset Yield Distribution Reform","Promote justified distribution of state owned assets yields.",""],[1,"51","18","Non-Public Enterprise Participation in State-Owned Enterprise Reform","Support non-public enterprises to participate in the reform of state owned enterprises.",""]],"4":[[1,"23","1","Circular Economy Development Enhancement","Enhance recourse efficiency and recycling economy development level.",""],[1,"31","13","Circular Production Methods Promotion","Unit One: Implement circular production methods",""],[1,"31","13","Circular Resource Use and Recycling System Enhancement","Unit Two: Enhance the circular use of resources and recycling system",""],[1,"31","13","Green Consumption Promotion Campaign","Unit Three: Popularize the green consumption model",""],[1,"31","13","Circular Economy Policy and Technical Support","Unit Four: Strengthen policy and technical support",""],[1,"32","3","Recycling System for Old Waste Products","Demonstrate a recycling system for old waste products",""],[1,"32","5","Industrialize Remanufacturing Industries","Industrialize remanufacturing industries",""],[1,"32","8","Circular Resource Techniques Demonstration","Promote the demonstration of circular resource techniques",""],[1,"32","9","Circular Economy Development and Resource Recycling Promotion","Vigorously develop the circular Economy.",""]],"5":[[1,"20","1","Domestic, Inbound, and Outbound Tourism Development Programme","We will comprehensively develop domestic tourism, actively develop inbound tourism, and encourage the orderly development of outbound tourism.",""],[1,"20","1","Tourism Infrastructure and Route Development","We will strengthen the tourism infrastructure, and promote major tourism sites and construction of tourism routes.",""],[1,"20","1","Tourism Product Diversification and Eco-Cultural Tourism Development","We will encourage the development of the tourist industries' defining characteristics and product diversification; we will comprehensively promote eco- tourism, encourage in-depth development of cultural tourism, and rigorously develop red tourism.",""],[1,"20","1","Tourism Service Quality and Self-Regulation Improvement","We will improve the tourism service system, strengthen the industry's self-regulation and integrity construction, and improve the quality of tourism services.",""]],"7":[[1,"7","5","SME Policy and Regulatory Improvement","Develop SMEs energetically, and improve the system of policies and regulations for SMEs.",""],[1,"7","5","SME Quality and Competitiveness Upgrading","Cause SMEs to accelerate the transformation of development patterns, strengthen quality and integrity building, and improve product quality and competitiveness.",""],[1,"7","5","SME Restructuring and Cluster Development","Promote the restructuring of SMEs, and improve the level of specialized division of labor.",""],[1,"7","5","SME Innovation and Management Capacity Development","Guide SMEs to develop in clusters, and improve innovation capability and management level.",""],[1,"7","5","SME Financial Services and Credit Guarantee System","Establish a sound financial service and credit guarantee system for SMEs, increase the size and percentage of lending to SMEs, and broaden channels of direct financing.",""],[1,"7","5","SME Preferential Tax Policy Support","Implement and improve preferential policies on taxation, etc. to relieve the social burden on SMEs.",""]],"8":[[1,"10","9","Advanced New Materials R&D and Industrialization Program","Promote the R&D and industrialization of carbon fibers, semiconductor materials, high temperature alloy materials, superconductive materials, high-performance rare earth materials and nanometer materials for aviation and spaceflight, energy and resources, traffic and transport, and major equipment.",""]],"9":[[1,"6","4","Equipment Manufacturing R&D and Industrialization Upgrade","The equipment manufacturing industry should improve the level of R&D and system integration of basic techniques, basic materials and basic components, strengthen the R&D and industrialization of critical technological equipment, and promote the intellectualization of equipment products.",""],[1,"8","1","Equipment Manufacturing Upgrading and Specialization Programme","Drive equipment manufacturing from a production-oriented style to a service- oriented style, and promote the development of numerically controlled products, green production and enterprise IT building.",""],[1,"8","1","Strategic Industry and Infrastructure Equipment Development","Develop equipment required for such key fields as new strategic industries and infrastructure.",""],[1,"8","1","Basic Manufacturing Techniques Specialization Initiative","Promote the specialized production of basic techniques, such as casting, forging, welding, thermal treatment and surface treatment, and improve the level of basic parts and components, such as bearings, gears, dies, hydraulics and automatic controls.",""],[1,"9","7","High-End Equipment Manufacturing Development","In the high-end equipment manufacturing industry, focus on the development of aviation equipment, satellites and application, rail traffic equipment and intelligent manufacturing equipment.",""],[1,"10","7","Industrialization Platforms for Advanced Equipment Manufacturing","Construct industrialization platforms for homemade trunk and feeder airplanes, general-purpose airplanes and helicopters, and a spatial infrastructure framework composed of navigation, remote sensing and communication satellites, and develop intelligent control systems, high-class numerically controlled machines, high-speed trains and urban rail traffic equipment, etc.",""]],"10":[[1,"18","2","Services Sector Development and Upgrading Initiative","We will promote the extensive development of the services sector as part of the optimisation of the industrial structure and upgrading of strategic priorities.",""],[1,"18","3","Professional Division of Labour and Producer Services Development","We will deepen the professional division of labour, accelerate innovation in services products and services models, promote the merging of production services and the advanced manufacturing industry, and promote the accelerated development of production services.",""],[1,"19","3","High-Tech Services Sector Development","With a focus on high-tech extension services and professional services related to support technology innovation, we will greatly develop the high-tech services sector.",""],[1,"19","3","Research and Development Industry Acceleration","The development of the research and development industry will be accelerated, and the transformation of industrial design from simple exterior design to high-end integrated design services will be promoted.",""],[1,"19","3","Information Services and Digital Content Development","We will strengthen information services, enhance the application level of software development, the development of information systems integration services, internet value-added services, information security services and digital content services, and develop the Geographic Information Systems industry.",""],[1,"19","3","Science and Technology Support Services Development","Furthermore, we will actively develop inspection and testing, intellectual property rights, and science and technology achievements as well as other science and technology support services.",""],[1,"19","3","High-Tech Enterprises and Brand Cultivation","We will cultivate the development of a number of high-tech services, key enterprises and famous brands.",""],[1,"19","5","Professional Services Development Initiative","We will push for the development of accounting, auditing, taxation, engineering consulting, certification and accreditation, credit evaluation, brokerage, management consulting, market research and other professional services.",""],[1,"19","5","Legal Services Development Initiative","We will actively advance the services of lawyers, notaries, forensics, economic and trade arbitration and other legal services.",""],[1,"19","5","Business Management Services Development Initiative","We will accelerate the development of project planning, mergers and acquisitions, financial advisory and other business management services.",""],[1,"19","5","Human Resources Services Regulation","We will regulate the development of personnel agencies, personnel recommendations, personnel training, staffing and other human resources services.",""],[1,"19","5","Conventions and Exhibitions Industry Development","To support advertising, the healthy development of the conventions and exhibitions industry will be encouraged.",""],[1,"19","6","Service Range Expansion and Quality Improvement","we will enrich the range of services, expand service provision and improve service quality to meet diverse needs.",""],[1,"20","6","Service Systems Innovation and Policy Improvement","service systems innovation will be promoted, the service policy system will be improved, and the developmental environment for services will be optimised.",""],[1,"20","8","Services Market Liberalization and Standardization Reform","We will establish fair, standardized and transparent market access standards, remedy sector fragmentation, regional blockades and industrial monopoly, expand the opening of the services sector, encourage and guide various types of capital investment in the services industry, vigorously develop a range of forms of service enterprise ownership, and establish an integrated, open, competitive and orderly services market.",""],[1,"20","8","New Service Format Market Regulation Pilot","We will explore market managing methods suitable for new types of services format development.",""],[1,"21","1","Services Sector Development and Institutional Mechanisms Exploration","services will be advanced and we will explore institutional mechanisms and effective methods for accelerating development benefitting the services industry.",""],[1,"21","3","Service Sector Regulatory and Support Package","We will implement the regulation that encouraged types of service sectors may purchase electricity, water, gas and heat at the same price as the industrial sector does.",""],[1,"21","3","Service Sector Supply and Land Access Expansion","We will expand the supplies granted to the services sector and the services sector will have priority in using land which is no longer claimed by industry.",""],[1,"21","3","Production Services Tax Reform","Combined with value-added tax reform, the tax system of production services will be reformed.",""],[1,"21","3","Service Sector Enterprise Financing Expansion","The financing channels for service sector enterprises will be broadened and the public financing and issuing of bonds of eligible enterprises will be supported.",""],[1,"21","3","Government Procurement of Services Expansion","We will expand the product range of government procurement services.",""],[1,"21","3","Service Standards System Development","We will establish and improve services standards systems.",""],[1,"21","3","Service Enterprise Branding and Digital Network Support","We will support service enterprises' brand and network building.",""],[1,"21","3","Service Industry Spatial Development Optimization","The distribution of service industry development will be optimised and the formation of metropolises will be promoted for the industrial structure of the service economy.",""]],"11":[[1,"5","2","Industrial Upgrading through Scientific Innovation","Promote industrial upgrading by scientific innovation",""],[1,"7","2","Enterprise Technical Upgrading Policy Support","Formulate policies that support the technical improvement of enterprises, and accelerate the application of new technologies, new materials, new techniques and new equipment to improve traditional industries and market competitiveness.",""],[1,"7","2","Enterprise Equipment and Process Modernization Support","Support enterprises to improve equipment level, optimize production processes, accelerate the elimination of backward technologies and equipment, and improve the overall level of integrated utilization of energy resources.",""],[1,"7","2","Enterprise Product Innovation and Upgrading Support","Encourage enterprises to enhance new product development capacity, increase the technology level and added value of products, and accelerate the upgrading of products.",""],[1,"7","2","Enterprise Digitalization and Management Innovation Programme","Promote the IT-based improvement and upgrading of such aspects as R&D and design, production circulation, and business administration, carry out advanced quality management, and promote the management innovation of enterprises.",""],[1,"7","2","Industry Technical Innovation Service Platforms","Build a number of industry technical innovation service platforms.",""],[1,"10","2","Industry Innovation and Development Projects","implement some major industry innovation and development projects, and foster a number of backbone enterprises and demonstration bases of new strategic industries for the purpose of mastering core industry technologies and accelerating large-scale industry development.",""]],"12":[[1,"5","3","Coordinated Regional Development Strategy","Accelerate coordinated and interactive regional development.",""],[1,"6","5","Industrial Productivity Layout Optimization","Optimize the productivity layout of key industries in light of regional functional positioning, and in consideration of such factors as energy resources, environmental capacity and market space.",""],[1,"6","5","Resource-Based Industrial Siting Policy","Major domestic products of energy and mineral resources are to be located in places rich in resources in central and western China with priority, and major projects that utilize imported resources mainly are to be located in coastal",""],[1,"7","1","Orderly Relocation of Urban Industrial Enterprises","The relocation of urban enterprises of iron and steel, non-ferrous metals and chemicals should be carried out orderly.",""],[1,"7","1","Optimization of Crude Oil Processing Capacity Layout","The layout of crude oil processing capacity should be optimized to promote the integrated development of upstream and downstream industries.",""],[1,"7","1","Advanced Manufacturing Base Development Initiative","Guide the clustering of production factors, and create a number of advanced manufacturing bases with international competitiveness based on key state projects.",""],[1,"7","1","Modern Industry Cluster Development Programme","Develop a number of modern industry clusters with distinctive characteristics, a prominent brand image and a sound service platform using industry chains as a tie and industrial parks as a medium.",""],[1,"7","4","Enterprise Alliance and Cross-Regional Merger and Reorganization","Drive advantaged enterprises to carry out alliance, cross-regional merger and reorganization, and increase industry concentration with focus on automobile, iron and steel, cement, machine building, electrolytic aluminum, rare earth, electronic information and pharmaceutical industries, etc.",""],[1,"7","4","Independent Brand Building and Global Brand Development","Promote independent brand building, improve brand value and effects, and accelerate the development of large enterprises with world- famous brands and core competencies.",""]],"13":[[1,"6","4","Modern Shipbuilding Industry Development","The shipbuilding industry should establish a modern shipbuilding pattern, and develop shipbuilding and supporting equipment with high technical added value in adaptation to new international shipbuilding standards.",""],[1,"8","2","Shipbuilding Upgrading and High-Value Vessel Development","Promote the upgrading of the three main vessel types of bulk vessel, oil tanker and container vessel in according to new international shipbuilding standards.",""],[1,"8","2","Ship Equipment Industry and Loading Efficiency Improvement","Improve the ship equipment industry and loading rate.",""],[1,"8","2","High-Tech Vessel Development Priority Programme","Give priority to the development of large liquefied natural gas (LNG) and liquefied petroleum gas (LPG) vessels, ocean-going fishing vessels, luxury liners, and other high-tech and high-added-value vessels.",""],[1,"8","2","Marine Engineering Equipment Design and Manufacturing Initiative","Accelerate the independent design and manufacture of mobile marine drilling platforms, floating production systems, marine engineering work ships, auxiliary ships, and key supporting equipment and systems.",""]],"14":[[1,"6","4","Smelting and Building Materials Industry Restructuring","The smelting and building material industries should control overall volume expansion strictly, optimize variety structure, and make new progress in product R&D, integrated resources utilization, energy conservation and emission reduction based on domestic demand.",""],[1,"6","4","Petrochemical Diversification and Upgrading","The petrochemical industry should explore new paths of diversified development of raw materials, focus on the development of high- end petrochemical products, accelerate the adjustment of fertilizer raw materials, and promote oil quality improvement.",""],[1,"6","4","Light Textile Industry Quality and Technology Upgrade","The light textile industry should strengthen environmental protection and quality safety, strengthen corporate brand building and improve technological equipment level.",""],[1,"6","4","Advanced Packaging Industry Development","The packaging industry should accelerate the development of advanced packaging equipment, new packaging materials and high- end packaging products.",""],[1,"6","4","Backward Capacity Elimination and Excess Capacity Reduction","Strengthen the elimination of backward production capacity, and suppress and channel off excess capacity.",""],[1,"8","4","Advanced Steel Materials and Clean Steel Technology Development","Focus on the development of steel for express railway, high-grade non-oriented silicon steel, high magnetic induction oriented silicon steel, high strength machine steel and other key steel varieties.",""],[1,"8","4","Industrial Energy Conservation and Emission Reduction Technology Upgrade","Focus on the development of energy conservation and emission reduction technologies, such as energy management and control system, high-temperature and high-pressure dry coke quenching, integrated residual heat utilization and desulfurization of sintering flue gas.",""],[1,"8","4","Raw Material Base Construction","Accelerate the construction of raw material bases.",""],[1,"8","5","Advanced Materials Development for Strategic Industries","Focus on the development of key materials required for aviation, spaceflight and electronic information.",""],[1,"8","5","Clean and Efficient Smelting Technology Upgrade","Support the extended application of cutting-edge smelting technologies, short and continuous processes, and energy conservation and emission reduction technologies, and encourage the recycling of renewable energy sources, and the integrated utilization of low-grade minerals, associated minerals, minerals that are difficult to recover and refine, tailings and waste residues.",""],[1,"8","6","New Materials Development Support","Focus on the development of photovoltaic glass, ultra-thin substrate glass, special fiberglass, special ceramics and other new materials.",""],[1,"8","6","Cement Kiln Co-disposal of Urban Domestic Waste","Support the co-disposal of urban domestic garbage based on cement kiln, and the construction of sludge production lines and exemplary lines of integrated utilization of waste building gases and materials.",""],[1,"8","6","Green Building Materials Development","Develop new building materials and products that meet green building requirements.",""],[1,"9","1","Large Integrated Smelting and Chemical Bases","Construct large integrated smelting and chemical bases.",""],[1,"9","1","Coal, Electricity, and Chemical Integration Demonstration Projects","Implement exemplary projects of coal, electricity and chemical integration, carbon dioxide utilization and mercury pollution control.",""],[1,"9","1","Oil Quality Upgrade and Olefin Feedstock Diversification","Ensure that oil quality attains the national IV standard, and the diversification rate of olefin raw materials attains 20%.",""],[1,"9","1","Phase-Out of High-Toxin and High-Residue Pesticides","Eliminate some high-toxin and high-residue pesticides.",""],[1,"9","2","Key Technologies Industrialization Promotion","Promote the industrialization of key technologies, such as new batteries, new agricultural plastics, energy-saving and environment-friendly electric power sources and intelligent white goods.",""],[1,"9","2","Equipment Localization for Key Industries","Accelerate the localization of equipment for key industries.",""],[1,"9","2","Forest and Paper Integration Engineering","Continue to promote forest and paper integration engineering.",""],[1,"9","2","Food Processing and Food Safety Capacity Building","Support further food processing, strengthen capacity building in food safety detection, and improve the quality and integrity system of food enterprises.",""],[1,"9","3","High-Tech and Functional Textile Industrialization Programme","Promote the industrialization and application of hi-tech fibers, and new- generation functional and differential fibers.",""],[1,"9","3","Industrial Textile Product Development Initiative","Accelerate the development of industrial textile products.",""],[1,"9","3","Localization of High-End Looms and Accessories","Promote the localization of high-end looms and accessories.",""],[1,"9","3","Textile Waste Recycling Support Programme","Support the recycling of old and waste textile products.",""]],"15":[[1,"21","6","Revitalization of the Old Industrial Base in Northeastern Region","Comprehensively revival the old industrial base of northeastern region.",""],[1,"21","6","Industrial Upgrading Initiative","Promote industrial upgrading and energetically develop the service sector of finance, logistics and tourism.",""],[1,"21","6","State-Owned Enterprise Reform","Deepening the SOE reform, consolidate the national grain strategic base, promote the restructure of resource-exhausted region.",""],[1,"21","6","National Grain Strategic Base Consolidation","Deepening the SOE reform, consolidate the national grain strategic base, promote the restructure of resource-exhausted region.",""],[1,"21","6","Resource-Exhausted Region Restructuring","Deepening the SOE reform, consolidate the national grain strategic base, promote the restructure of resource-exhausted region.",""],[1,"21","8","Eastern Region Development Support","Actively support the leading position of eastern region development.",""],[1,"21","8","International Cooperation and Competition Upgrading","Participating international cooperation and competition in higher level, fostering the development of emerging strategic sector, modern service sector and advanced manufacturing.",""],[1,"21","8","Institutional Innovation for Socialist Market Economy Reform","Promote the institutional innovation, first to improve the socialism market economic system.",""],[1,"22","4","Industrial Upgrading and Service Sector Development","Take advantage of strong industrial and technological base, improve the modern industrial system, promote upgrading of the advantage industries such as equipment manufacturing, raw materials, automobiles and agricultural products deep processing, etc, Vigorously develop service industries such as financial, logistics, tourism and software and outsourcing industries.",""],[1,"22","4","State-Owned Enterprise and Collective Enterprise Reform","Deepen the reform of state-owned enterprises, speed up the reform of collective corporate owned by factories and the disposal of 'debt turn to share' assets, vigorously develop non-public economy and SMEs.",""],[1,"22","4","Agricultural Development Transformation and National Food Base","Speed up the transformation of agricultural development, build a solid national food strategic base.",""],[1,"22","4","Ecological Protection and Economic Transformation of Key Mountain Areas","Focus on protection of black land, wetland, forests and grassland, promote the ecological protection and economic transformation of Daxinganling Xiaoxinganling and Changbai mountains.",""],[1,"22","4","Resource-Depletion Area Transformation and Sustainable Development","Promote transformation and development of resource depletion areas, enhance sustainable development capacity of resourced cities.",""],[1,"22","4","Coordinated Transformation of Old Industrial Bases","Co- ordinately promote the transformation of old industrial bases nationwide.",""],[1,"23","1","Old Industrial Base Revitalization and Western Development Policy Implementation","Further refine and implement the policies of boom old industrial base and the western development policies.",""],[1,"23","3","National Innovation City and Regional Innovation Platform Development","Focus on enhance the construction of national innovation cities and regional innovation platform.",""],[1,"23","3","Strategic Emerging Industries, Modern Services, and Advanced Manufacturing Development","Focus on cultivating industrial competitive advantage, speed up the development of strategic emerging industries, modern service industries and advanced manufacturing industries.",""],[1,"23","3","Socialist Market Economy System Reform","Focus on promoting system innovation, takes the lead to improve socialism market economy system.",""],[1,"23","3","Regional Integration and Coastal Development Initiative","Promote development of integration of Jing Jin Ji, Changjiang River Delta, Zhujiang River Delta areas, create the capital economic circle, focus on promoting the development of Hebei coastal areas, Jiangsu coastal areas, Zhejiang Zhoushan islands districts, West Coast economic zone, Shangdong peninsula blue economic zone, etc, and build Hainan international tourist island.",""]],"16":[[1,"34","5","Free Nine-Year Compulsory Education","nine-year compulsory education free of charge",""],[1,"34","5","Free Secondary Vocational Education for Priority Students","secondary vocational education free of charge for rural students, students from urban families in economic difficulties and students studying agriculture-related majors",""],[1,"34","5","Pre-Primary Education Subsidies for Vulnerable Children","subsidies provided to children from families in economic difficulties, orphaned and disabled children to receive pre-school education",""]],"17":[[1,"45","3","Employment Expansion Initiative","Expand the employment scale in both rural and urban areas",""],[1,"45","11","Employment and Social Security Service System Improvement","Improve the employment and social security service system",""],[1,"46","6","Expansion of Public Employment and Social Security Service Facilities","Reinforce the building of service facilities for public employment, social security, labour Inspection, mediation and arbitration services.",""],[1,"46","6","Social Security All-in-One Card Promotion","Promote the use of social security all-in-one card.",""]],"18":[[1,"3","4","Job Creation Priority","giving priority to job creation",""],[1,"3","4","Income Distribution Reform","stepping up reform of the income distribution system",""],[1,"4","11","Domestic Demand Expansion Mechanism","establish long term mechanism of expanding domestic demand.",""],[1,"4","11","Employment as Priority Strategy","implementing the strategy of employment as priority,",""],[1,"4","11","Distribution Reform","deepening the distribution reform and improving social security system,",""]],"19":[[1,"44","4","Elderly Social Care Service System Development","Establish the social service system for the elderly involving family, communities and service provider institutions.",""]],"20":[[1,"35","1","Basic Social Insurance Expansion","urban employees and residents to enjoy basic pension scheme, and rural residents to enjoy new countryside social pension scheme; b) urban employees and residents to enjoy basic medical insurance, and rural residents to enjoy new countryside cooperative medical scheme; c) urban employees to enjoy unemployment insurance, work injury insurance and maternity insurance",""],[1,"39","5","Social Security System Expansion","Accelerate the establishment of social security system, which will cover both urban and rural residents,",""],[1,"39","7","Social Insurance System Improvement","Accelerate the improvement of social insurance system",""],[1,"39","8","New Rural Social Pension Insurance Scheme Full Coverage","Achieve the full coverage of the new rural social pension insurance scheme",""],[1,"39","9","Pension Insurance Scheme Improvement","Improve the pension insurance scheme for urban workers and non-working urban residents (reaching the basic pension insurance at provincial pooling level; reaching basic pension funds at national pooling level and accomplishing the portability of pension insurance )",""],[1,"39","10","Urban-Rural Pension Scheme Integration","Promote gradually the effective interface/link between urban and rural pension schemes.",""],[1,"39","11","Civil Service Pension Scheme Reform","Initiate the reform of pension scheme for civil servants and staff of public agencies",""],[1,"39","12","Enterprise Annuity and Occupational Pension Development","Develop the enterprise annuity and occupational pension",""],[1,"39","13","Work Injury Insurance Scheme Improvement","Improve the working injury insurance scheme (increasing coverage, raising benefit level, establishing an integrated working injury insurance system covering prevention, compensation and rehabilitation).",""],[1,"39","14","Unemployment and Maternity Insurance Scheme Improvement","Improve unemployment insurance and maternity insurance schemes.",""],[1,"39","14","Commercial Insurance Complementary Role Expansion","Bring commercial insurance into play for its complementary role.",""],[1,"40","6","Medical Insurance System Improvement","Improve the medical insurance system",""]],"21":[[1,"35","1","Minimum Living Allowance and Social Assistance Services","provide urban and rural residents living in economic difficulties with minimum living allowances, medical assistance, funeral and internet assistance and other services",""],[1,"35","1","Welfare Services for Special Groups","provide welfare services to special groups of people including orphaned children, disabled people, households enjoying the five guarantees (childless and infirm old persons who are guaranteed food, clothing, medical care, housing and burial expenses), and elderly seniors",""],[1,"39","15","Urban and Rural Minimum Living Standard Security System Improvement","Improve the urban and rural minimum living standard security systems",""],[1,"39","16","Minimum Living Standard Adjustment and Subsidy Increase Mechanism","Improve the dynamic adjustment mechanism of minimum living standard and increase the subsidy standard",""],[1,"39","17","Strengthen Social Protection Policy Linkages","Strengthen the policy links between the urban-rural minimum living standards, minimum wage, unemployment insurance, and poverty reduction.",""],[1,"39","17","Increase Rural Five Guarantees Support Level","Raise the support level of rural five guarantees",""],[1,"39","18","Special Care and Placement System Strengthening","Strengthen the special care and placement system",""],[1,"39","19","Natural Disaster and Temporary Relief System Improvement","Improving natural disaster system and temporary relief system",""],[1,"39","21","Expansion of Social Welfare Security Coverage and Benefit Levels","Enlarge gradually the scope and the benefit level of social welfare security.",""],[1,"39","22","Social Welfare Service System Improvement","Improve social welfare service system by combination of family, community and welfare agency.",""],[1,"40","1","Welfare Services for Persons with Disabilities and Orphans","Strengthen the welfare service for the disabled and the orphan.",""],[1,"40","2","Philanthropy Development and Charity Support Policy","Speed up the development of philanthropy through raising awareness, developing charities and putting the tax preference policy for public welfare donations into effect.",""]],"22":[[1,"45","5","Pension Benefit Increase","Increase the pension benefit level",""],[1,"45","21","Nationwide Coordination of Basic Pension Fund for Urban Employees","Achieve nationwide coordination of basic pension fund for urban employees.",""],[1,"45","21","Urban Pension Insurance Enrollment Expansion","Increase the number of urban residents newly enrolled in the pension insurance scheme by 100 million people.",""],[1,"45","21","Urban Basic Pension Improvement","Steadily increase the basic pension received by urban employees; urban non-employed residents above the age of 60 to enjoy basic pension.",""],[1,"45","21","New Countryside Social Pension Scheme Coverage Expansion","Achieve full coverage of new countryside social pension scheme, and increase the standard of basic pension.",""],[1,"46","7","State-Owned Assets Gains Transfer and Social Security Financing Mechanism","Enlarge the scope of state-owned assets gains that should be handed in to the state; steadily increase the percentage collected from the state-owned assets gains, with the incremental part mainly used for expenditures on people's livelihood such as social security.",""]],"23":[[1,"17","8","Marine Environmental Protection and Ecosystem Restoration Plan","Make unified planning of marine environmental protection and land-based pollution, and strengthen the protection and recovery of the marine ecosystem.",""],[1,"17","8","Offshore Resource Conservation and Reclamation Regulation","Prevent the overexploitation of offshore resources, strengthen reclamation management, and regulate the utilization of unoccupied sea islands strictly.",""],[1,"17","8","Marine Disaster Relief and Emergency Response System","Improve the marine disaster relief system, and strengthen the handling capability of marine emergencies.",""]],"24":[[1,"22","2","Ecological Protection and Disaster Prevention Initiative","Strengthen environment protection, strengthen geological disasters prevention, promote construction of key ecological function areas, continue to implement key ecological projects, and build the national ecological security barrier.",""],[1,"33","2","Ecological Safety Barrier Establishment","Unit One: Establish an ecological safety barrier",""],[1,"33","2","Ecological Protection and Management Strengthening","Unit Two: Strengthen ecological protection and management",""],[1,"33","2","Ecological Compensation Mechanism Establishment","Unit Three: Establish ecological compensation mechanisms",""],[1,"33","3","Disaster Protection and Consequence Mitigation Measures","This plan will improve protection against natural disasters and mitigate their consequences.",""],[1,"33","3","Ecological Restoration and Reforestation Programme","We will reverse the trend of ecological degradation from the grassroots by implementing major ecological restoration and bolstering natural forest conservation and reforestation.",""],[1,"33","3","Desertification Control and Grassland-Wetland Protection","We will also comprehensively deal with desertification and soil petrification and preserve grasslands and wetlands.",""],[1,"33","3","Ecological Compensation and Functional Area Protection Mechanism","In addition, this plan will accelerate the establishment of ecological compensation mechanisms and the protection of major ecologically functional areas.",""],[1,"33","3","Water and Soil Conservation through Sand Consolidation","It will reinforce water and soil conservation by promoting sand consolidation.",""]],"25":[[1,"60","5","Military Modernization and Innovation Drive","make technological development an important guiding principle in national defense and military, implement modern military strategies.",""],[1,"60","7","Military-Civilian Integration Roadmap","Adhere to the roadmap of military and civilian integration, optimize the scientific development system for arms and weapons and the system of personnel training.",""]],"26":[[1,"6","4","Electronic Information Industry Innovation Upgrade","The electronic information industry should improve R&D level, enhance the capability to develop basic electronics independently, and be guided toward the higher end of the industry chain.",""],[1,"10","5","New-Generation Digital Network Construction","Construct new-generation mobile communication networks, the new-generation Internet, and digital broadcast and television networks.",""],[1,"10","5","Internet of Things Demonstration Projects","Implement exemplary application projects of the Internet of things and special industrialization projects of network products.",""],[1,"10","5","Industrial Bases for Integrated Circuit, Display, and Software Industries","Construction industrial bases of IC, panel display, software and information services.",""],[1,"16","4","National Broadband and New-Generation IT Infrastructure Construction","Accelerate the construction of a broadband, converged, secure and ubiquitous new-generation national IT infrastructure, and promote the deep convergence of IT building and industrialization, and IT building in all socioeconomic fields.",""],[1,"16","6","Integrated Next-Generation Communications Network Construction","Plan new-generation mobile communication networks, the new-generation Internet, digital broadcast and television networks in a unified manner, and promote the construction of satellite communication facilities, and create an ultra-high-speed, large-capacity and highly intelligent national trunk line transmission network.",""],[1,"16","6","Broadband Expansion and Urban Fiber Connectivity","Guide the construction of broadband wireless cities, promote the door-to-door connection of urban optical fibers, accelerate the construction of broadband networks in rural areas, and increase bandwidth popularity rate and access bandwidth comprehensively.",""],[1,"16","6","Telecom and Broadcasting Convergence Regulatory Framework","Establish sound laws, regulations and standards with focus on the two-way access of radio and television, and telecom operations, realize the convergence of the telecom network, the radio and television network, and the Internet, and promote network interconnection and operation convergence.",""]],"27":[[1,"17","3","Network and Information Security Regulatory Reform","Improve laws and regulations on network and information security, the system of standards, and the system of certification and authentication for information security.",""],[1,"17","3","Information Security Rating and Risk Assessment System","Implement information security rating protection, risk assessment and other relevant systems.",""],[1,"17","3","Secure and Controllable Software and Hardware Demonstration and Extension","Accelerate the demonstration and extension of key secure and controllable software and hardware, strengthen information network monitoring and control capabilities, and ensure the security of basic information networks and key information systems.",""],[1,"17","3","Information Security and Secret Protection Infrastructure Construction","Promote the construction of information security and secret protection infrastructure, and build an information security and secret protection system.",""],[1,"17","3","Internet Management and National Network Security Strengthening","Strengthen Internet management, and ensure national network security and information security.",""]],"28":[[1,"17","1","E-Government and Government Information Systems Integration","Promote e-government building greatly, drive the interconnection, information sharing and operational coordination of key governmental information systems, construct and improve online administrative approval, information disclosure, online complaint handling, electronic supervision and auditing systems.",""],[1,"17","1","Key Sector Information Systems and Basic Data Resource Platform Development","Strengthen the building of key information systems, such as market regulation, social security and medical care, and improve basic information resources system for geography, population, legal person, finance, taxation and statistics, strengthen the integration of information resources, regulate collection and distribution, and strengthen integrated social development and utilization.",""]],"29":[[1,"52","7","Fiscal Taxation System Reform","Actively establish a fiscal taxation system that is beneficial to the transformation of the economic system.",""],[1,"53","1","Tax System Reform Package","Expend the scope of value added tax, and reduce business taxes.",""],[1,"53","1","Personal Income Tax Reform","Improve personal income tax system.",""],[1,"53","1","Administrative Fee Conversion to Taxes","Transform administrative fees to taxes.",""],[1,"53","1","Resource Tax Reform","Promote reform in resource taxes and farmland use tax.",""],[1,"53","1","Farmland Use Tax Reform","Promote reform in resource taxes and farmland use tax.",""],[1,"53","1","Property Tax Reform","Promote reform on property tax.",""]],"30":[[1,"37","3","Income Distribution System Reform","Uphold and improve the distribution system whereby distribution according to work is dominate and multiple forms of distribution exist side by side.",""],[1,"37","4","Wage System Reform","Deepen reform of wage system",""],[1,"37","5","Minimum Wage and Wage Guideline Reform","Improve the minimum wage system and the wage guideline system.",""],[1,"37","6","Distribution System Reform","Improve the distribution system to allow factors of production such as labor, capital, technology and managerial expertise to have a justified share according to their respective contribution",""],[1,"37","7","Redistribution Adjustment Mechanism Establishment","Accelerate the establishment of the redistribution adjustment mechanism based on taxation, social security and transfer payment.",""],[1,"37","7","Tax Burden Reduction for Low- and Middle-Income People","Reduce the tax burden on low- and middle-income people.",""],[1,"37","8","Income Distribution System Rectification and Standardization","Rectify and standardize the income distribution system.",""],[1,"37","10","Salary System Reform","Deepen the reform of salary system",""],[1,"37","11","Distribution System Improvement","Improve the system to take into account the key elements of capital, technology and management in distribution",""],[1,"37","12","Public Resources Assignment Reform","Improve a transparent, fair and equitable public resources assignment system; establish a mechanism for all Chinese people to share the gains from assignment of public resources including land, sea areas, forest and minerals; gains from the assignment to be mainly used for expenditures on public services.",""],[1,"38","1","Performance-Based Salary Determination System","Establish and improve the system to determine salary according to operational and management performance, risks and responsibilities; strictly standardise the income of managers, especially senior managers, of state-owned enterprises and financial institutions in which the state holds a controlling stake.",""],[1,"38","2","Redistribution Adjustment Mechanism Improvement","Accelerate improvement of the re-distribution adjustment mechanism with taxation, social security and transfer payment as the key instruments.",""],[1,"38","4","Income Distribution System Reform","Accelerate the formation of a reasonable and orderly Incomes Distribution system",""],[1,"38","7","Wage Payment Guarantee and Salary Information System Reform","Strengthen the wage payment guaranteeing system, raise the minimum salary standard, Establish the enterprise salary survey system and the salary information distribution system,",""],[1,"38","8","State-Owned Enterprise Payroll Management Reform","Reform the payroll management approach in the state-owned enterprise and adjust the payroll and salary standard in some industries aimed at reducing the widening gaps between urban and rural areas and among different industries.",""],[1,"38","8","Public Servant Wage System Improvement","Perfect wage system for public servant",""],[1,"38","9","Public Resource Revenue National Sharing System","Establish public resource (forest, sea, land and mineral) revenue national sharing system; contribute the benefits mainly to public service.",""],[1,"38","10","Increase Fiscal Revenue from State-Owned Capital Income","Contribute a larger scope and portion of state-owned capital incomes to fiscal revenue",""],[1,"38","10","Recognize Technological Achievements in Income Distribution","Ensure the technological achievement get deserving consideration in income distribution",""],[1,"38","11","State-Owned Enterprise Wage and Expense Regulation","Establish a rational wage system and regulate the income and mission expense of senior managers in state-owned enterprise and State-owned holding company.",""],[1,"38","12","Personal Income Tax Reform","Adjust the personal income tax threshold and the personal income tax rate structure and enlarge the high-income group's tax .",""],[1,"38","13","Fiscal Expenditure Structure Adjustment","Adjust the fiscal expenditure structure; raise the expenditure proportion for public service and social security, raise resident social incomes.",""],[1,"39","1","Income Distribution Legal and Regulatory Reform","Perfect the law and regulations, strengthen the government management and the law enforcement to accelerate the establishment of a transparent and fair incomes distribution system.",""],[1,"39","2","Regulation of Additional Income in Public Institutions and State-Owned Enterprises","regulate the divers incomes in addition to salary in public institution and stated-owned enterprise.",""],[1,"39","3","Non-Tax Revenue Management Reform","Strengthen the Non-tax revenue management, ban and regulate divers' administrative fee and government funds and accelerate the construction of monitoring system.",""]],"31":[[1,"58","7","Socialist Law-Based State Construction","Fully realize the vision of a lawfully governed state, optimize the legal system of the socialism with Chinese characteristics, protect the unity, dignity and authority of socialism legal system, just and incorruptible enforcement of the law, strengthen the education of the wide population of the law, create a good atmosphere in society of everyone studying and respecting the law, speed up the building of a socialist lawful state.",""],[1,"58","7","Human Rights Protection and Advancement Initiative","Strengthen the guarantee of human rights, advance the overall development of human right matters.",""],[1,"58","8","Socialist Legal System Improvement","Improve the socialist legal system with Chinese characteristics.",""],[1,"58","8","Legislative Reform for Economic and Social Development","Put emphasis on legislation relating to accelerating transformation of the economic growth mode, improving people's livelihood, developing social causes and government building.",""],[1,"58","9","Constitution and Law Enforcement Strengthening","Strengthen enforcement of the Constitution and law.",""],[1,"58","9","Governance by Law and Fair Enforcement Initiative","Advance governance by law and fair and clean enforcement.",""],[1,"58","9","Judicial System Reform","Deepen judicial system reform.",""],[1,"58","9","Legal Publicity and Education Campaign","Further promote publicity and education on law",""],[1,"58","10","Legal Assistance and Human Rights Protection Strengthening","Strengthen legal assistance; enhance protection of human rights; promote the comprehensive development of the human rights cause.",""]],"32":[[1,"60","11","Comprehensive Evaluation and Assessment System","Implement comprehensive evaluation and assessment system",""],[1,"60","12","Plan Supervision and Midterm Evaluation Mechanism","Strengthen the supervision and assessment of the plan.",""],[1,"60","13","Plan Implementation and Public Resource Allocation Mechanism","To ensure smooth implementation of the Plan, mainly rely on market forces to play their basic role in allocating resources; government at all levels should correctly perform their duties to rationally allocate public resources, and ensure the objectives and tasks under the Plan can be met.",""],[1,"61","3","Policy Planning and Coordination Strengthening","Strengthen overall policy planning and coordination",""],[1,"61","5","Performance Evaluation and Appraisal System Reform","Accelerate the development of a performance evaluation and appraisal system and specific appraisal methods that are conducive to advancing scientific development and accelerating transformation of the economic growth mode; weaken the evaluation and appraisal based on the speed of economic growth, while strengthen a comprehensive evaluation and appraisal on fulfilment of the objectives and tasks including structural optimisation, improvement of people's livelihood, resources conservation, environmental protection, basic public services and social management.",""],[1,"61","6","Plan Monitoring and Evaluation System Strengthening","Improve the monitoring and evaluation system, enhance capacity building in this regard, strengthen statistics work concerning the service industry, energy- conservation and emission reduction, climate change, labour and employment, income distribution and real estate.",""],[1,"61","6","Plan Implementation Surveillance and Analysis","Stress the surveillance and analysis on the progress with implementation of the Plan.",""],[1,"61","6","Departmental Plan Implementation Evaluation","The relevant departments of the State Council should strengthen evaluation on implementation of the Plan in their respective fields, and be subject to supervision and examination by the National People's Congress and its Standing Committee.",""],[1,"61","6","Annual Plan Progress Reporting and Public Disclosure","The competent authority assuming responsibilities under the Plan should conduct evaluation on fulfilment of the binding and the key expected indicators, submit an annual progress report on implementation of the Plan to the State Council, and release information to the public in an appropriate manner.",""],[1,"61","6","Mid-term Plan Review","The State Council will organise a comprehensive mid-term review during implementation of the Plan,",""],[1,"62","1","Mid-term Plan Evaluation and Adjustment Procedure","and submit a mid-term evaluation report to the Standing Committee of the National People's Congress for examination.",""],[1,"62","2","Implementation Mechanism Strengthening","Improve an implementation mechanism featuring clear responsibilities, categorised implementation and effective supervision.",""],[1,"62","3","National-Level Special Plans Compilation and Implementation","The relevant departments of the State Council should organise compilation of a set of national-level special plans, in particular key special plans, and specify and put into practice the key tasks set out in the Plan.",""],[1,"62","4","Local Plan Coordination with National Development Strategy","The local plans should effectively implement the national strategic objectives, take into account the local realities and highlight the local characteristics.",""],[1,"62","4","Alignment of Local Plans with Development Strategies and Indicators","Make the local plans well coordinated with the development strategies, major objectives and key tasks set out in this Plan, with focus on strengthening their connections with the binding indicators.",""],[1,"62","5","Annual Plan Alignment with the National Plan","Strengthen the connections between the annual plans and this Plan; annual goals should be set towards meeting the major objectives and fully reflect the development objectives and key tasks set out in the Plan.",""],[1,"62","5","Annual Plan Implementation Progress Reporting","Annual reports should analyse the progress with implementation of this Plan, especially the fulfilment of binding indicators.",""]],"33":[[1,"52","2","Government Function Separation and Administrative Streamlining Reform","Accelerate the separation of the functions of the government from those of enterprises, state assets management authorities, public institutions and market-based intermediaries.",""]],"34":[[1,"59","1","Code of Conduct for Clean Government Implementation","Conscientiously implement the Code of Conduct for Building Clean and Honse Government, and implement the system whereby leading cadres regularly report their incomes, real estate and investments, as well as what their spouses and children do.",""],[1,"59","2","Anti-Corruption Enforcement and Prevention System","Put emphasis on improving the system to punish and prevent corruption;",""],[1,"59","3","Anti-Corruption and Clean Government Reform","strengthen anti-corruption and building a clean government.",""],[1,"59","4","Officials' Integrity and Asset Disclosure Reporting System","Strengthen honesty and self-discipline of officials; seriously implement the regular reporting system of officials' income, real estate property, investment as well as employment of their spouses and children.",""],[1,"59","5","Anti-Corruption System Reform and Innovation","Deepen reform and system innovation, and gradually establish an effective anti- corruption system that is scientific in content and rigorous in procedures.",""],[1,"59","6","Power Structure and Operational Coordination Mechanism","Establish and improve a power structure and an operational mechanism featuring mutual restriction and coordination of powers for decision-making, enforcement and supervision; and vigorously push forward transparency of government affairs and audit of economic responsibilities.",""],[1,"59","7","International Anti-Corruption Cooperation","Enhance international exchange and cooperation in anti-corruption.",""]],"35":[[1,"24","2","National Land and Space Development Optimization","Optimize the development structure of national land and space.",""],[1,"24","3","Regional Category Management Policy","Implement regional policy of category management.",""],[1,"24","5","Transition Mechanism Improvement","Establish and improve the transition mechanism.",""],[1,"24","5","Regional Development and Major Function Planning","Improve regional development, key projects planning according to the Major Function strategy.",""],[1,"24","5","Regional Development and Environment Index Study","Study and formulate the index of development and environment for different region.",""],[1,"24","6","National Spatial Development Regulation","standardize space development order, control space development intensity and form the high- efficient, harmonized and sustainable space development structure.",""],[1,"24","8","Unified Spatial Planning for Population, Economy, Land Use, and Urbanization","Plan China's population distribution, geographical distribution of the different sectors of the economy, territory utilization and urbanization pattern in a unified way, lead the population and economy to concentrate to the areas that are suitable to",""],[1,"25","1","Spatial Development Zoning and Land-Use Control Measures","Optimize development in the region where population is dense, land development density is already high and resource environmental bearing capacity is heavy.",""],[1,"25","2","Differentiated Fiscal Transfer and Investment Policy for Functional Zones","The central finance shall increase the financial transfer payment, year by year, to main production area of agricultural products, and key ecology function area, especially the Midwest key ecology function area, increase the protection ability to basic public service and ecologic environment.",""],[1,"25","2","Differentiated Industrial Guidance Catalogue Reform","Modify and perfect the current industrial guidance catalogue, clarify the encouraged, limited and prohibited industrial for different principle function areas.",""],[1,"25","2","Differential Land Use Control and Emissions Standards","Implement the differential land management policy, scientifically set the different land using scale, and carry out strict land use control.",""],[1,"25","2","Differentiated Pollutant Emission Control and Environmental Standards","Implement different pollutant emission volume control and environment standards to different principle function area.",""],[1,"25","2","Policy Reform for Agriculture, Population, Ethnic Affairs, and Climate Response","Perfect the policies regarding agriculture, population, nationality and responding to climate change.",""],[1,"26","2","National Spatial Planning and Functional Zoning Reform","According to the requirement of promoting the formation of principle function area, perfect the regional planning, complete the coordination of specific project planning, key project planning and principle function area.",""],[1,"26","2","Urban and Rural Spatial Planning Framework","Advance the cities and countries' space planning, fix the regional principle function orientation; clarify the layout of function areas.",""],[1,"26","2","Functional Area Development Density and Environmental Capacity Standards","Study and draw up obligatory targets of development density, environmental capacity for various principle function areas, and timely implement.",""],[1,"26","2","National Spatial Dynamic Monitoring and Evaluation System","Perfect the national spatial dynamic monitoring and management system which should be covering the whole country, coordinating cohesively, and updating in a timely manner, carry out the tracking evaluation to principle function areas' construction.",""]],"36":[[1,"57","5","Socialist Democratic Rule and Rule-of-Law Governance","We will continue to develop socialist democratic rule and to build a socialist country with the rule of law.",""],[1,"58","1","Socialist Political Civilization Construction","Speed up the construction of socialist political civilization.",""],[1,"58","1","Representative and Political Consultation System Improvement","Adhere and improve the representative system National People's Congresses, the cooperation of leaders of the CPC with different parties and the system of political consultation, the self-governing system of minority areas and the self-governing system at the basis of society.",""],[1,"58","1","Patriotic United Front Consolidation","Consolidate and expand the wide patriotic united front.",""],[1,"58","1","Minority and Religious Affairs Education Initiative","To realize the work for minorities and religions, strengthen the united education of different ethnics.",""],[1,"58","4","Democratic Governance and Participation Reform","Improve the system of democracy, expand the channels of democracy, carry out democratic elections, democratic decision-making, democratic management and democratic supervision according to law, and safeguard the people's right to know, participate, express and supervise.",""],[1,"58","6","Ethnic Minority Policy Implementation","Fully implement the Party and the state's policy on ethnic minorities ...",""],[1,"58","6","Religious Policy Implementation","and the Party's basic guidelines on religion.",""],[1,"58","6","New Social Class Mobilization for Socialist Construction","Encourage people from new social class to devote themselves to building socialism with Chinese characteristics.",""]],"37":[[1,"53","2","Internal Management and Risk Management Strengthening","Strengthen internal management and risk management.",""],[1,"53","2","National Development Bank Reform","Deepen the reform of the National Development Bank",""],[1,"53","2","Export-Import Bank and Export Credit Insurance Reform","press ahead with the reform of Export-Import Bank of China and China Export & Credit Insurance Cooperation",""],[1,"53","2","Agriculture Bank of China Reform","advance the reform of Agriculture Bank of China",""],[1,"53","2","Postal Savings Bank of China Reform","the reform of Postal Savings Bank of China.",""],[1,"53","2","Deposit Insurance System Establishment","Establish deposit insurance system.",""],[1,"53","3","Commercialized Transition of Financial Asset Management Companies","Press ahead with the commercialized transition of the financial asset management companies.",""]],"38":[[1,"54","2","Active Opening-Up and Reform Expansion Strategy","We must implement more active strategies for \"opening up\" and unceasingly explore the new areas of reform.",""],[1,"54","2","Balanced Trade and Investment Reorientation","China must adapt to a more balanced growth model, in which we place equal stress on imports, exports, attracting foreign capital and promoting outbound investments, instead of the current dependence on exports and foreign capital.",""],[1,"54","2","Demand-Based Economic Model Transition","We must adapt the system to a demand-based economic model and effectively prevent risks in order to promote development, reform and innovation.",""],[1,"54","3","Expansion and Coordination of Opening-Up Policies","China will continue the expansion of \"opening up\" policies and coordinate the opening up of coastal, inland and bordering areas to achieve a mutually beneficial and balanced pattern of \"opening up\".",""]],"39":[[1,"55","5","Service Sector Export Promotion and Opening-Up Initiative","We will promote export of services, deepen the \"opening up\" of outbound service sectors and increase the share of service trade in the total foreign trade.",""],[1,"55","5","Traditional and Emerging Service Export Expansion","While expanding and stabilizing the export of traditional service sectors such as tourism and transportation, we will also make great efforts to promote the export of culture, Chinese medicine, software and information services, logistics in business and trade, financial insurance, and other service sectors.",""],[1,"55","5","Liberalization of Education, Health, and Sports Services","we will steadily open up fields such as education, medicine, sports etc, to attract good resources, to improve the service standard to the international level.",""],[1,"55","5","Service Outsourcing and Service Contracting Base Development","We will vigorously develop service outsourcing and establish several \"service contracting bases\".",""],[1,"55","5","Financial and Logistics Sector Opening-Up","We will expand the \"opening up\" of financial, logistical and other service sectors, and in a stable way \"open up\" education,",""]],"40":[[1,"54","5","Coastal Area Opening-Up Reorientation","We will change the focus of the \"opening up\" of coastal areas from international manufacturing to research and development, advanced manufacturing and services.",""],[1,"54","5","Service Sector Opening-Up and Trade Promotion","We will also push for a further \"opening up\" of the service sector, promote the development of international trade in services, and attract foreign investment in the service sector.",""],[1,"54","5","Special Economic Area Opening-Up Expansion","In this, we will deepen the \"opening up\" of the special economic areas of Shenzhen and other cities, Shanghai Pudong New Area and Tianjin Binhai New Area.",""],[1,"54","5","Shanghai International Financial and Trade Centre Development","We will speed up the internationalization of Shanghai as a centre for finance, shipping, and trade.",""],[1,"54","7","Inland Area Opening-Up and Investment Zone Development","The \"opening up\" of inland areas will depend on central cities, urban clusters and various investment and development zones.",""],[1,"54","7","Investment Environment Optimization and Foreign Investor Attraction","We will make use of natural resources and the comparative advantages of labour, optimize the investment environment, and expand the use of \"leading industries\" for foreign investors.",""],[1,"54","7","International Manufacturing and Service Contracting Bases Development","Inland areas must actively adapt to the migration of international manufacturing enterprises and coastal industries toward inland areas; inland areas must cultivate and develop a number of bases for international manufacturing and service contracting.",""],[1,"54","7","Chongqing Liangjing New Area Opening-Up Initiative","We will drive ahead the \"opening up\" of Chongqing's \"Liangjing New Area.\"",""],[1,"54","9","Border Area Opening-Up Policy Package","we will make use of these areas' regional advantages and formulate and implement special \"opening up\" policies.",""],[1,"54","9","Border Ports and Development Zone Construction","We will speed up the construction of key ports, border cities, border (and cross-border) economic cooperation zones and key development and experimental zones.",""],[1,"54","9","Border Connectivity and Special Outward Industries Development","We will enhance the infrastructure and connection with the neighbouring countries and develop \"special outward industries\" and industrial bases.",""],[1,"59","10","Hong Kong Offshore RMB and International Asset Management Center Development","Support Hongkong develop to the off-shore rmb business center and international asset management center, consolidate and lift its position as international finance, trade and shipping center, strengthen the global influences as financial center.",""],[1,"59","10","Macao Global Tourism and Leisure Center Development","Support Maco to build global tourism and leisure center.",""],[1,"59","11","Support for Emerging Sector Development in Hong Kong and Macao","Support Hongkong and Macao to foster emerging sectors.",""],[1,"59","12","Guangdong-Hong Kong-Macao Cooperation Framework Implementation","Implement the cooperation framework agreement between Guangdong/Kongkong and Guangdong/Macao, promote regional economic development, build advanced manufacturing and service sector base.",""],[1,"59","12","Pearl River Delta Transport Connectivity Improvement","Strengthen planning and coordination, improve the transportation system between pearl river delta and Hongkong/Macao.",""],[1,"59","13","Cross-Strait Peaceful Development and Economic Cooperation","In the current phase advance the cross-strait relations.",""],[1,"60","1","Cross-Strait Exchange Expansion and Mechanism Development","actively expand cross-straits exchanges in all areas, advance the process of cross-strait exchange mechanisms, build a framework for the peaceful development of cross-strait relations.",""],[1,"60","2","Cross-Strait Economic Cooperation Mechanism","Establish and improve the cross-strait economic cooperation mechanism",""],[1,"60","4","West Coast Economic Zone Development","Support the development of West Coast Economic Zone",""]],"41":[[1,"13","5","Integrated National Transport Network Development","Develop different modes of transport proactively in a unified manner.",""],[1,"13","6","Special Railway and High-Speed Rail Construction","Accelerate the construction of special passenger railway lines, inter-regional trunk lines and coal transport channels, and develop high-speed railways for passenger and freight transport.",""],[1,"13","6","National Expressway and Trunk Highway Expansion","Strengthen the construction of bottleneck points in the national expressway network, and the expansion of national and provincial trunk highways.",""],[1,"13","6","Inland Water Transport and Port Modernization","Drive the construction of high-grade waterways, and promote the standardization of vessels for inland water transport and enlarge ports.",""],[1,"13","6","Bulk Freight Transport and Coastal Port Upgrading","Improve transport systems for coal, petroleum, iron ore and container, etc., and improve the modernity of coastal port groups.",""],[1,"13","6","Aviation Network and Airspace Management Reform","Improve the aviation network with international pivotal airports and trunk line airports being the backbone, and feeder airports as a supplement, promote the development of general-purpose aviation, reform the airspace management mechanism, and improve the efficiency of utilization of airspace resources.",""],[1,"13","7","Multi-layer Inter-city Express Traffic Network Construction","Promote the construction of multi-layer inter-city express traffic networks of city groups taking rail traffic and expressways as the backbone, and national and provincial trunk highways as a supplement.",""],[1,"14","5","Integrated Transport Hub Construction and Multimodal Connectivity","Strengthen the organic connection of railways, highways, ports, airports and urban public traffic, and accelerate the construction of integrated traffic hubs according to the requirements of zero-distance transfer and seamless freight connection.",""],[1,"14","5","Passenger Ticket Integration and Through Freight Service Reform","Optimize transport organization, carry out innovative service pattern, and promote passenger ticket integration and through freight traffic.",""],[1,"14","6","National Rail and Expressway Network Expansion","Construct 4 longitudinal and 4 transverse passenger transport special lines, inter- city rail traffic trunk lines in city groups, the second double line of the Lan-Xin Railway and such inter-regional trunk lines as Zhengzhou-Chongqing.",""],[1,"14","6","Expressway Railway Network Completion","Complete an expressway railway network with an operating mileage of 45,000 kilometers, and basically covering cities with a population of over 500,0000, and western China trunk lines, such as the Lhasa-Shigatse Railway.",""],[1,"14","6","Coal Transport Corridor Construction","Construct coal transport lines from central and south Shanxi, and western Mongolia to central China.",""],[1,"14","6","Qiongzhou Strait Sea-Crossing Project Feasibility Study","Study the feasibility of constructing the Qiongzhou Strait sea-crossing project and the Sichuan-Tibet Railway.",""],[1,"14","8","National Expressway Network Completion","Complete a national expressway network consisting of 7 radial lines, 9 longitudinal lines and 18 transverse lines largely, with an available mileage of 83,000 kilometers, basically covering cities with a population of over 200,000.",""],[1,"14","8","National and Provincial Trunk Highway Improvement","Strengthen the improvement of national and provincial trunk highways, increase the proportion of Class 2 or above national highways to over 70%, and connect",""],[1,"15","2","Construction of Major Bulk and Container Port Terminals","Construct coal loading ports in northern China, coal transit and storage bases in eastern and southern China, large crude oil handling terminals in Dalian and other ports, large iron ore handling terminals in Ningbo, Zhoushan and other ports, and container terminals in Shanghai, Tianjin and other ports.",""],[1,"15","3","Yangtze River and Canal Navigation Channel Improvement Programme","Regulate the upper Yangtze River channel, implement the channel management project for the Jingjiang River section of the Yangtze River, and extend the 12.5- meter-deep channel at the estuary of the Yangtze River upward.",""],[1,"15","3","Xijiang River and Beijing-Hangzhou Canal Capacity Expansion Programme","Implement the Xijiang River trunk shipping channel capacity expansion project, and the Beijing- Hangzhou Canal improvement project, and promote the construction of the high- grade channel network of the Yangtze River Delta, and other high-grade channels.",""],[1,"15","4","Airport Construction and Expansion Programme","Construct a new airport in Beijing, expand the airports of Guangzhou, Nanjing, Changsha, Haikou, Harbin, Nanning, Lanzhou and Yinchuan, construction a number of new branch line and general-purpose airports, and study the feasibility of constructing new airports in Chengdu, Qingdao and Xiamen.",""],[1,"15","4","New-Generation Flight Control Systems Development","Accelerate the construction of new-generation flight control systems.",""],[1,"15","6","National Integrated Traffic Hub Construction","Construct 42 national integrated traffic hubs.",""]],"42":[[1,"6","4","Automobile Industry Technology Upgrading","The automobile industry should strengthen the R&D capability of complete vehicles, realize the technical autonomy of key parts, and improve the level of energy conservation, environmental protection and security technology.",""],[1,"8","3","Automotive Industrial Innovation and Energy Efficiency Programme","Build a system for principle, production and industrialization innovation.",""],[1,"9","7","New Energy Automobile Development","In the new energy automobile industry, focus on the development of plug-in hybrid electric vehicles, pure electric",""],[1,"11","1","New-Energy Automobile R&D and Commercialization Demonstration Program","Conduct R&D and large-scale commercialization demonstration projects for plug-in hybrid electric vehicles and pure electric vehicles, and promote industrialized application.",""]],"43":[[1,"14","3","Public Traffic Priority Strategy","Implement a public traffic priority strategy to develop urban public traffic systems greatly and increase the proportion of public traffic in overall traffic.",""],[1,"14","3","Urban Rail Transit Network Development","Design technical routes for urban rail traffic scientifically, regulate construction standards, and promote the construction of urban rail traffic networks, including light rail, subway and trolley car.",""],[1,"14","3","Bus Rapid Transit Expansion","Develop ground rapid transit systems actively, and increase line density and station coverage.",""],[1,"14","3","Urban Taxi Regulation and Non-Motorized Transport Promotion","Regulate the urban taxi industry, guide private motor vehicle travel rationally and advocate non-motor-vehicle traffic.",""],[1,"14","3","Integrated Urban and Rural Public Transport Planning","Plan integrated urban and rural public traffic in a unified manner.",""],[1,"14","7","Urban Rail Transit Network Development","Build urban rail traffic network systems in Beijing, Shanghai, Guangzhou and Shenzhen, etc., complete main urban rail traffic frameworks in Tianjin, Chongqing, Shenyang, Changchun, Wuhan, Xi'an, Hangzhou, Fuzhou, Nanchang and Kunming, etc., and plan rail traffic backbone lines in Hefei, Guiyang, Shijiazhuang, Taiyuan, Jinan and Urumqi, etc.",""]],"44":[[1,"14","5","Transport Digitalization and Advanced Equipment Upgrade","Extend the application of advanced equipment and technologies to improve the IT building level of traffic.",""],[1,"14","5","Green Transport Development and Highway Freight Reduction","Develop energy-saving and environment-friendly means and modes of transport, and drop and pull highway transport greatly.",""],[1,"14","5","Transport Safety Management Strengthening","Strengthen safety management to ensure transport safety.",""]],"45":[[1,"5","1","Agricultural Modernization Initiative","consolidate the foundation for agricultural development, speeding up agricultural modernization.",""]],"46":[[1,"23","1","Economic Belt Construction and Regional City Cluster Development","Speed up the construction of the economic belts along Longhai, Jingguang, Jingjiu and Changjiang river, promote agglomeration of population and industries, strengthen the abutment joint and connection with surrounding cities.",""],[1,"23","1","Development of Key City Groups and Economic Zones","Focus on promoting the development of Tianyuan city group, Wanjiang city belt, Boyanghu Lake ecological economic zone, the central plains economic zone, Wuhan city circle, Chang-Zhu-Tan city circle group, etc.",""],[1,"26","4","Strategic Urbanization Planning and City Cluster Development","Establish the strategic planning for urbanization.",""],[1,"27","1","Coordinated Urban Development and Urbanization Layout","objective rules of urban development, depending on big cities and focusing on small cities, gradually forming urban agglomeration with radiation effects and foster the coordinated development of large, middle and small cities as well as small towns.",""],[1,"27","1","Strategic Urbanization Corridor Layout","Building strategic layout of urbanization by taking the road bridge channels and border long river channels as the two horizontal axes, and the sea border, Jing Ha Jing Guang and Bao Kun channels as the three vertical axes, depending on numbers of cities on the axes, and other urbanized areas and cities as important integral parts",""],[1,"27","2","Urban Agglomeration Development and City Function Optimization","Gradually building urban agglomeration with international competitiveness in eastern areas, breeding and developing numbers of urban agglomeration in middle western areas of which the conditions are mature.",""],[1,"27","2","Urban Functional Zoning and Infrastructure Integration","Scientifically programming the function positioning of cities in the urban agglomeration, relieving the pressure of the central districts of super cities, strengthening the industrial functions of middle and small cities, heightening public service functions and residential functions of small towns, pushing forward the unified construction of infrastructures and internet development of large, middle and small cities.",""],[1,"27","2","Small and Medium City Development Support","Actively digging out the development potential of middle and small cities, giving priority on developing middle and small cities that have obvious regional advantageous and stronger resource and environment capacity.",""],[1,"27","2","Focused Small Town and Border Port Development","Developing small towns with focus, gradually developing central towns of eastern areas, county towns of middle west areas and important border ports that has certain conditions into middle or small cities.",""]],"47":[[1,"35","2","Low-Rent Housing Provision for Urban Low-Income Families","provide low-rent housing to urban low-income families with housing difficulties",""],[1,"35","2","Public Rental Housing for Urban Lower-Middle-Income Families","provide public rental housing to urban lower-middle-income families with housing difficulties",""],[1,"42","9","Housing Mechanism and Policy System Reform","accelerate improvement of housing mechanism and policy system that are in line with the national conditions",""],[1,"42","10","Housing Supply System Improvement","Improve housing supply system",""],[1,"42","11","Low-Income Housing Supply Expansion","Increase the supply of low-income housing",""],[1,"42","13","Housing Mechanism and Policy System Reform","Persist in the combination of the government control and the market regulation, to perfect the housing mechanism and the policy system that applies to the Chinese condition.",""],[1,"42","13","Balanced Housing Supply and Demand Framework","Gradually set up a housing demand - and - supply pattern under which the gross is balanced in general, the structure is reasonable in general, the housing price and the consumption capacity adapt in general, so as to realize the housing assurance for the public.",""],[1,"43","1","Housing Demand-Supply System Establishment","accelerate the establishment of the housing demand - and - supply system in which the basic assurance are provided mainly by the government while the demand of multi-level are filled mainly by the market itself.",""],[1,"43","1","Low-Income Urban Rental Housing Mechanism","for the low-income families with housing difficulties in town, to practice the low-price renting mechanism",""],[1,"43","1","Public Rental Housing Mechanism","for the lower- middle-income families with housing difficulties, to practice the public renting mechanism",""],[1,"43","1","Mixed Rent-to-Buy Housing Mechanism","for the up-middle-income families with housing difficulties, to practice the mechanism that combine the renting and purchasing of the commercial house.",""],[1,"43","1","Housing Standards and Sustainable Consumption Framework","Establish and perfect the housing standard system which is commercial, adaptable, environmental friendly and resources saving, advocate the consumption model that applies to the domestic condition.",""],[1,"43","2","Affordable Housing Construction and Supply Expansion","Strengthen the governmental responsibility, put more effort on the construction of the affordable housing project, basically release the supply deficiency of the affordable house.",""],[1,"43","2","Low-Cost Rental Housing and Rental Subsidy Mechanism","Collect the low-price renting house resources from multi-channel, perfect the renting subsidy mechanism.",""],[1,"43","2","Public Rental Housing Development Programme","Give priority to the development of the public renting house, gradually make it the main body of the affordable house.",""],[1,"43","2","Shantytown Reconstruction Programme","Accelerate the reconstruction of the shanty towns.",""],[1,"43","2","Affordable Housing Investment and Financing Mechanism","Establish a stable investment mechanism, enhance the support of the fiscal fund, the house fund loan and the bank loan, steer the public participation and the construction of the affordable house.",""],[1,"43","2","Affordable Housing Regulation and Supervision Framework","Strengthen the management of the affordable house, make a just, open and transparent policy and supervision procedure, strictly follow the standard for access, retreat and charge.",""],[1,"45","10","Urban Housing Project for Low-Income Families","Implement the urban housing project for low-income families",""],[1,"46","5","Urban Low-Income Housing Construction and Renovation Programme","Construct and renovate 36 million apartments for urban low-income families; the coverage of low-income housing to reach 20% nationwide.",""]],"48":[[1,"41","4","Public Hospital Governance and Administrative Reform","we will actively explore the effective ways that institutions stop performing government functions, that supervision be separated from day to day operations, that healthcare be separated from pharmacy and that for profit institutions be separated from non-profit ones.",""],[1,"41","4","Modern Hospital Administration and Personnel Management System","Accelerate administrative system of modern hospital, establish scientific and reasonable system for selecting and employing personnel and system for distribution.",""],[1,"41","4","Public Hospital Subsidy System Reform","Reform the subsidy system for public hospital and actively press forward the reform",""],[1,"42","1","Public Hospital Management and Service Process Improvement","we will strongly improve the internal management of public hospital, optimize the service process, and standardize the diagnosis and treatment in order to make it convenient for communities.",""],[1,"42","1","Multi-Practice Registration for Doctors","Advance the system whereby the registered doctors are allowed to work in more than one practice,",""],[1,"42","1","Standardized Resident Training System","establish standardized training system for residents,",""],[1,"42","1","Health Worker Motivation Initiative","close attention should be paid to mobilize the activity of medical staff.",""]],"49":[[1,"40","4","Public Health Service System Strengthening","Strengthen the building of public health service system",""],[1,"40","5","Urban and Rural Medical Service System Strengthening","Strengthen the building of urban and rural medical service system",""],[1,"40","7","Medicine Supply System Improvement","Improve the medicine supply system",""],[1,"40","8","Public Hospital Reform","Actively and steadily advance the reform of public hospitals",""]],"50":[[1,"41","3","Basic Drug Supply Guarantee System","We will put in place a sound system to guarantee supplies of basic drugs based on the national system.",""],[1,"41","3","National Basic Drug System Implementation","We will fully implement the national system for basic drugs at the primary level and gradually equip to its utmost and preferentially use the basic drugs in other medical institutions.",""],[1,"41","3","Basic Drug List and Pricing Adjustment System","Establish dynamic list adjustment system of basic drugs, improve the systems of both price formation and dynamic adjustment, and increase the actual reimbursement level.",""],[1,"41","3","Drug Production Oversight and Procurement Regulation","Strengthen the drug producing oversight, overhaul the distribution order of the drugs, standardize the concentrated drug procurement and drug safety of medical institutions.",""]],"51":[[1,"29","1","Green and Low-Carbon Development Promotion","We will establish green and low carbon development ideas and focus on energy conservation and emission reduction, improve incentives and constraint mechanisms, and stimulate the establishment of resource-saving and environmentally friendly production and consumption to strengthen sustainable development and improve ecological standards.",""],[1,"29","3","Energy Conservation and Efficiency Improvement Measures","This plan will reasonably restrict energy consumption, decrease the growth of industries with high energy consumption, and increase energy efficiency.",""],[1,"29","3","Energy Conservation Assessment and Standards Reform","The plan will strengthen energy conservation assessment responsibilities, complete energy-saving regulations and standards, improve market mechanisms and implement pivotal energy-saving projects.",""],[1,"29","3","Advanced Energy-Saving Technology Deployment","It will popularize advanced energy-saving technologies, accelerate the application of the Energy Management Contract, and pay adequate attention to industries such as construction and transportation.",""],[1,"29","3","Energy Structure Adjustment and Non-Fossil Energy Expansion","We will revise energy consumption structures and increase the use of non-fossil energy resources as well as increase forest cover,",""],[1,"31","2","Energy Conservation Management and Efficiency Standards","We will strengthen energy conservation management.",""],[1,"31","8","Energy Performance Contracting Promotion","Promote energy performance contracting",""]],"52":[[1,"11","5","Energy Structure Optimization and Modern Energy Industry Development","Strengthen reciprocal international cooperation, adjust and optimize energy structure, and build a safe, stable, economical and clean modern energy industry system.",""]],"53":[[1,"11","7","Coal Industry Integration and Restructuring","Develop safe and efficient coal mines, and large coal enterprise groups, and promote the integration of coal resources, and the merger and reorganization of coal mine enterprises.",""],[1,"11","7","Coal-Based Fuel and Co-Production Industrialization","Carry out R&D demonstration of coal-based natural gas, coal-based liquid fuels and coal-based co-production orderly, and promote industrialization steadily.",""],[1,"11","7","Oil and Gas Exploration and Unconventional Resource Development","Strengthen the exploration and development of petroleum and natural gas resources, stabilize domestic petroleum output, and promote the rapid growth of natural gas output, and the development and utilization of unconventional oil and gas resources, such as coal-bed gas and shale gas.",""],[1,"11","7","Clean Coal-Fired Power Generation Development","Develop clean and efficient large- capacity coal-fired generating sets, giving priority to heat and power cogeneration units in large/medium cities and industrial parks, large coal-fired power stations near coal mines, and integrated coal gangue power stations.",""],[1,"11","7","Hydropower Development and Pumped Storage Planning","Develop hydropower actively on the precondition of proper ecological conservation and resettlement, focus on the construction of large-sized hydropower stations in southwestern China, develop medium and small river waterpower resources based on local conditions, and plan and construct pumped storage power stations scientifically.",""],[1,"11","7","Safe and Efficient Nuclear Power Development","Develop nuclear power on a safe and efficient basis.",""],[1,"11","7","Grid Connection Infrastructure Expansion","Strengthen the construction of grid-connection works, and develop wind power effectively.",""],[1,"11","7","Renewable Energy Development","Develop solar energy, biomass energy, geothermal",""],[1,"12","1","Distributed Energy Systems Expansion","Promote the extended application of distributed energy systems.",""],[1,"12","3","National Integrated Energy Bases Construction","construct five national integrated energy bases in Shanxi, the Ordos Basin, eastern Inner Mongolia, southwestern China and Xinjiang",""],[1,"12","3","Nuclear Power Development in Eastern Coastal and Central Areas","develop nuclear power in the eastern costal region and some areas in central China mainly",""],[1,"12","3","Local Energy Processing and Transformation Upgrade","improve the level of local energy processing and transformation to reduce the pressure of large-scale and long-distance energy transmission",""],[1,"12","3","Energy Storage and Strategic Reserve System Development","Plan and construct energy storage facilities rationally, improve the petroleum reserve system, and strengthen the capacity of natural gas and coal reserve and peak molulation",""],[1,"12","5","Coal Base Construction and Expansion Programme","Accelerate the construction of coal bases in northern Shaanxi, Huanglong, Shendong, eastern Inner Mongolia and eastern Ningxia, drive the construction of coal bases in northern, eastern and central Shanxi, Yunnan and Guizhou steadily, and start the construction of the Xinjiang coal base.",""],[1,"12","5","Large Coal-Fired Power Base Construction Programme","Construct some large coal- fired power bases on the basis of the above coal bases.",""],[1,"12","6","Large-Scale Oil and Gas Production Area Development","Create the 5 large-scale oil and gas producing areas of the Tarim and Junggar Basins, the Liaosong Basin, the Ordos Basin, the Bohai Bay Basin and the Sichuan Basin, accelerate the exploration and development of offshore and deep- water oil and gas fields, and strengthen the production and utilization of coal-bed gas in coal mine areas.",""]],"54":[[1,"13","3","Outward Power Supply and Cross-Regional Transmission Infrastructure","Accelerate the construction of outward power supply projects from large coal power, hydropower and wind power bases, and create some cross-regional power transmission channels using advanced technologies.",""],[1,"13","3","High-Voltage Power Transmission Line Expansion","Complete 330 kV or above power transmission lines of 200,000 kilometers.",""],[1,"13","3","Smart Grid and Electric Vehicle Charging Infrastructure","Carry out trials of intelligent power grid construction, improve substations to intelligent ones, extend the application of intelligent watt-hour meters, and construct electric vehicle charging facilities.",""]],"55":[[1,"10","8","Industrial Bases for New Energy Equipment","Construct industrial bases for new-generation nuclear power equipment, large wind power generating sets and parts, new assemblies of efficient solar power generation and heat utilization, biomass energy conversion and utilization technologies, and intelligent power grid equipment, and implement exemplary large-scale application projects of marine wind power, solar power and biomass energy.",""],[1,"12","7","Nuclear Power Development and Construction Programme","Accelerate the development of nuclear power in coastal provinces, promote nuclear power construction in central provinces steadily, and construct nuclear power projects with a total installed capacity of 40 million kW.",""],[1,"12","8","Large-Scale Hydropower Station Construction","Construct large-sized hydropower stations in key watersheds, such as those of the",""],[1,"13","1","Hydropower Project Construction on Jinsha, Yalong and Dadu Rivers","Jinsha, Yalong and Dadu Rivers, and commence the construction of hydropower projects with a total installed capacity of 120 million kW.",""],[1,"13","1","Large Wind Power Base Construction Programme","Construct 6 onshore and 2 coastal and offshore large wind power bases, with an additional installed capacity of over 70 million kW.",""],[1,"13","1","Solar Energy Power Station Construction Programme","Construct solar energy power stations with a total installed capacity of over 5 million kW with focus on Tibet, Inner Mongolia, Gansu, Ningxia, Qinghai, Xinjiang and Yunnan.",""]],"56":[[1,"55","2","Foreign Trade Transformation and Export Competitiveness Upgrade","We will speed up the transformation of foreign trade and promote the transformation of foreign trade development from volume-increasing to quality improving and profit increasing; we will compete with comprehensive advantages instead of cost advantages.",""],[1,"55","3","Export Market Diversification and Competitiveness Upgrade","While maintaining the current advantage in export markets we will also speed up the nurturing of new advantages based on technology, branding, quality and service.",""],[1,"55","3","Quality Upgrade for Labour-Intensive Export Products","We will improve the quality and class of labour-intensive export products, expand the export of electronic machinery and high-tech products, strictly limit the export of products that require wasteful use of energy and resources, and lead to high levels of pollution.",""],[1,"55","3","Transition from Processing Trade to Higher Value-Added Activities","We will optimize policy measures to promote the transition from processing trade to R&D, design, manufacturing of the key components and logistics etc, to extend the value-added chain in China.",""],[1,"55","3","Customs Special Supervision Policy Optimization","We will optimize the special supervisory policy and function of the Customs, to encourage the centralization of the processing trade into the Customs special supervisory area.",""],[1,"55","3","Enterprise International Sales Channel Development","We encourage enterprises to build up international sales channels to increase their ability to expand international market shares.",""],[1,"55","3","Emerging Market Development and Export Diversification","We will actively develop emerging markets and promote the diversification of the export market.",""],[1,"55","4","Import Structure Optimization and Diversification Policy","We will optimize the structure of imports, actively expand imports of advanced technology, key components, domestically rare resources and energy-conservation and environmental protective products.",""],[1,"55","4","Consumer Goods Import Expansion Policy","We will expand the import of consumer goods to a reasonable degree and make use of the important macro-economic balancing and structure-adjusting role of imports and optimize the structure of trade payments.",""],[1,"55","4","Import Source Diversification Initiative","We will make full use of the attractiveness and influence of China's huge market and promote the diversity of import sources.",""],[1,"55","4","Key Agricultural Products Import and Export Control Mechanism","We will optimize the controlling mechanism of the import and export for key agricultural products in order to use international resources effectively.",""],[1,"57","4","Free Trade Zone Development Acceleration","China's strategies of formulating Free Trade Zones should be speeded up.",""]],"57":[[1,"48","1","Social Management System Innovation and Capacity-Building","innovate the mechanism of social management system; strengthen social management capacity building, build and improve the social management system with Chinese characteristics, and ensure that the society is full of vitality, harmony and stability.",""],[1,"48","2","Social Management Structure Reform","Improve social management structure.",""],[1,"48","3","Social Management System Innovation","Innovate social management system.",""],[1,"48","5","Social Management Pattern Improvement","Improve the social management pattern which features the Party taking the leadership, the government assuming the responsibility (service-oriented government), the society (social organisations, enterprises and public institutions) providing collaborative support and the public engaged in orderly participation.",""],[1,"48","6","Social Management Mechanism Innovation","2. Innovate the social management mechanism",""],[1,"48","7","Social Management Mechanism Strengthening","Accelerate building of the social management mechanism which combines tackling issues at their source, dynamic management and emergency response:",""],[1,"48","10","Community Governance Management Structure Reform","Improve the management structure of community.",""],[1,"48","10","Community Self-Governance Strengthening","Strengthen the autonomous system under the leadership of the Party, achieve positive interaction between government administrative management and public autonomy.",""],[1,"49","2","Integrated Social Management and Service Platform","Construct the platform for social management and service.",""],[1,"49","3","Community Governance Structure Improvement","Improve the governance structure of communities",""],[1,"49","4","Grassroots Community Self-Governance Improvement","Improve the system of grass-roots mass self-governance under the leadership of community Party organisations; advance the community residents' democratic management of community affairs and public welfare establishments according to law; achieve effective connection and sound interaction between government administration and grass-roots mass self-governance.",""],[1,"49","4","Community Neighbourhood Committee Strengthening","Improve the system of community neighbourhood committees ....",""],[1,"49","4","Community Service and Mutual Assistance Organization Development","actively develop community service, public welfare and mutual assistance social organisations ... guide various kinds of social organisations and volunteers to participate in community management and service.",""],[1,"49","4","Local Social Management Innovation Initiative","Encourage innovation of social management and service mode that suit local circumstances.",""],[1,"49","5","Community Management and Service Platform","Build community management and service platform",""],[1,"49","6","Grassroots Public Service System Improvement","Improve the grass-roots management and service system; ... extend the basic public services function ...",""],[1,"49","6","Professional Community Service Agency Development","Standardise and develop professional service agencies such as community service stations to effectively undertake tasks assigned by grass-roots government authorities.",""],[1,"49","6","Integrated Local Service Resource Management","Integrate management functions and service resources in such areas as population, employment, social security, civil affairs, health, culture as well as comprehensive management, maintaining stability and handling complaints.",""],[1,"49","6","Floating Population Service Management","Strengthen management of services to floating population.",""],[1,"49","7","Community Service Capacity Enhancement","Plan to enhance the service capacities of urban and rural communities",""],[1,"49","8","Comprehensive Community Service Platform","Build a comprehensive community service platform",""],[1,"49","10","University Student Community Service Plan","Implement a plan for 500,000 university students to serve in urban and rural communities",""]],"58":[[1,"43","5","Family Planning Policy Improvement","Insist on the basic state policies of family planning, gradually improve related policies.",""],[1,"43","5","Preferential Support System for Compliant Families","Improve the preferential policy system for families obeying the family planning rules.",""],[1,"43","5","Family Development Capacity Enhancement","Increase family development capacity.",""],[1,"43","5","Family Subsidy Increase","Increase the amount of subsidies for families",""],[1,"44","1","Population and Family Planning Service System Expansion","Continuously promote the construction of population and family planning service systems, expand the service scope.",""],[1,"44","1","Family Planning Rule Enforcement and Dynamic Adjustment Mechanism","obeying the family planning rules, expanding the beneficiary groups and establishing the dynamic adjustment mechanism.",""],[1,"44","1","Sex Ratio Imbalance Control Measures","Comprehensively curb the trend of expanding sex ratio of the newly-born.",""],[1,"44","1","Newborn Deformity Prevention Measures","Strengthen the measures to prevent the newly-born deformity problems.",""],[1,"44","1","Family Planning Services for Floating Population","Strengthen the management of family planning service to floating population.",""],[1,"45","14","Family Planning Services Enhancement","Enhance family planning services",""]],"59":[[1,"3","3","Science, Education, and Talent Rejuvenation Strategy","Through comprehensively implementing the strategy of rejuvenating our country through science and education and talents, we will give full play to the role of science and human resources.",""],[1,"3","3","Indigenous Research and Innovation Capacity Upgrade","China should upgrade its capabilities in indigenous research and innovation in science, technology and administration, train more innovative talents and improve education for workers.",""],[1,"3","3","Innovation Country Construction Initiative","we will strive to speed up the construction of an innovation country.",""],[1,"3","6","Scientific Development Support Mechanism","Efforts should be made in building up a mechanism of advantage to scientific development.",""]],"60":[[1,"33","5","Water Supply Protection Capacity Improvement","Unit One: Improve the water supply protection capacity",""],[1,"33","5","Flood Control Capacity Enhancement","Unit Two: Enhance high flood control capacity",""],[1,"33","5","Extreme Weather and Disaster Forecasting and Emergency Response Strengthening","Unit Three: Strengthen forecasting, prevention and emergency response to extreme weather, earthquakes and natural disasters",""],[1,"33","6","Disaster Risk Assessment and Early Warning Systems","We will accelerate the establishment of investigation and assessment systems in disaster-prone areas as well as developing a warning system, control system and emergency response system.",""],[1,"33","6","Geographic Disaster Management Strengthening","The present plan will reinforce geographic disaster management in key areas, put together rescue teams, and raise the level of material support.",""],[1,"33","6","Natural Disaster Risk Evaluation and Land-Use Allocation","It will also forge natural disaster risk evaluation and reasonably allocate production and living facilities in dangerous areas.",""]],"61":[[1,"56","2","Balanced Inward and Outward Investment Strategy","China will continue the combination of the strategies 'bringing in' and 'going out' and to pay equal attention to both foreign investments in China and Chinese investments abroad in order to increase safe and effective use of the two markets and their resources.",""],[1,"56","4","Foreign Investment Optimization and Attraction Policy","China will optimise the structure of foreign capital by guiding foreign investments to the sectors of modern agriculture, high-end technology, advanced manufacturing, energy conservation, new energy, modern service industry etc. and encourage foreign capital to be invested in the middle and western parts of China.",""],[1,"56","4","Foreign Participation in Domestic Mergers and Acquisitions","China will encourage foreign capital to use different means to take part in merger and acquisitions of domestic enterprises, such as buying shares, joint ventures etc.",""],[1,"56","4","Foreign Talent, Technology, and R&D Center Attraction Initiative","China will bring in senior talent and advanced technology from overseas and encourage foreign enterprises to set up R&D centres in China in order for China to learn advanced international management concepts and systems.",""],[1,"56","4","Investment Climate and Investor Rights Protection Reform","The soft environment of investments will be optimised and the legal rights of investors will be protected.",""],[1,"56","4","National Security Review of Foreign Mergers and Acquisitions","China will conduct the National Security Review of foreign merger and acquisitions in a good fashion.",""],[1,"56","4","Foreign Lending and External Debt Management","Favourable foreign lending and international commercial lending will be used effectively to fine tune the management of foreign debt.",""]],"62":[[1,"56","6","Overseas Investment Cooperation Strategy","China will follow the strategy of market orientation and self-willingness of enterprises to guide enterprises with different ownerships to develop overseas investment cooperation in an orderly manner.",""],[1,"56","6","International Energy Resources and Processing Cooperation","China will deepen the development of international energy resources and mutually beneficial processing cooperation.",""],[1,"56","6","Overseas Technology R&D Investment Support","China will support the carrying out of technology R&D investments abroad and to encourage leading enterprises in the manufacturing industry to conduct foreign investment to create internationalised marketing and sales channels and famous brands.",""],[1,"56","6","International Agricultural Cooperation and Overseas Engineering Contracts","China will enlarge international cooperation in the agricultural sector and develop overseas engineering contracts, labour cooperation and cooperation projects that can improve living standards in local areas.",""],[1,"56","6","Cross-Border Corporations and Financial Institutions Development","China will gradually develop its own large cross country corporations and cross country financial institutions to increase China's level of international operations.",""],[1,"56","6","Overseas Investment Research and Project Evaluation","China will conduct research for overseas investments and enhance scientific evaluation of investment projects.",""],[1,"56","6","Cross-Agency Coordination and Going-Out Support System","China will increase its ability of comprehensive all-round consideration, optimize the cross- agency coordination system, and enhance the guidance and services to enforce the 'going out' strategy.",""],[1,"56","6","Overseas Investment Legal and Regulatory Framework","The formulation of laws and regulations concerning overseas investments will be speeded up and optimised.",""],[1,"56","6","Investment Protection and Double Taxation Agreement Negotiation","China will actively discuss and sign mutual agreements on investment protection and agreements to avoid double taxation as well as other multilateral or bilateral agreements.",""],[1,"56","6","Overseas Investment Promotion and Facilitation System","China's overseas investment promotional system will be improved to increase the level of investment facilitation for enterprises to invest overseas and to protect the overseas rights of China and to minimize different kinds of risks.",""],[1,"57","1","Corporate Social Responsibility Requirements for Overseas Cooperation Projects","overseas cooperation projects should bear corporate social responsibility in mind in order to bring benefits to the local people.",""]],"63":[[1,"17","4","Marine Development Strategy and Control Capacity Enhancement","Develop and implement a marine development strategy based on unified sea and land planning, and improve marine development and control capabilities.",""],[1,"17","6","Scientific Marine Economy Development Plan","Plan the development of the marine economy scientifically, exploit and utilize marine resources rationally, develop marine oil and gas, marine transport, marine fishing and coastal travel industries greatly, and expand marine biopharmaceutical, integrated seawater utilization, marine engineering equipment manufacturing and other rising industries.",""],[1,"17","6","Marine Technology Research and Development Strengthening","Strengthen the R&D of basic, proactive and critical marine technologies, improve marine technology level, and improve marine development and utilization capabilities.",""],[1,"17","6","Port and Coast Resource Integration and Port Layout Optimization","Deepen the integration of port and coast resources, and optimize port layout.",""],[1,"17","6","Marine Economy Master Planning","Develop and implement marine master plans, optimize the spatial layout of the marine economy.",""],[1,"17","6","Marine Economy Pilot Demonstration Zones","Carry out trials of marine economy development in Shandong, Zhejiang and Guangdong Provinces.",""],[1,"17","8","Marine Governance Coordination and Management Mechanism","Improve the marine management mechanism through enhanced coordination.",""],[1,"17","8","Sea Area and Island Management Reform","Strengthen sea area and island management, improve the market mechanism for sea area use rights, promote the protection and utilization of sea islands, and support the development of remote seas islands.",""],[1,"17","8","Integrated Marine Surveying and Polar Research Programme","Strengthen integrated marine surveying and mapping, and carry out polar and oceanic scientific investigation actively.",""],[1,"18","1","Marine Legal and Law-Enforcement Strengthening","maritime laws, regulations and policies, and enhance marine law-enforcement to maintain the order of exploitation of marine resources.",""],[1,"18","1","Marine Affairs Diplomacy and Transport Channel Security","Strengthen bilateral and multilateral marine affairs negotiation, participate in international marine affairs actively, ensure the safety of marine transport channels, and maintain our country's marine rights and interests.",""]],"64":[[1,"40","16","Basic Medical and Health Care System Reform and Expansion","we increase the government investment, deepen the reform of pharmaceutical and healthcare system, set up and improve the basic medical and health care system, speed up the development of medical and health care, give a priority to meet the basic medical and health of urban and rural residents.",""],[1,"40","17","Public Health Care Network Improvement","We will improve the public health care network to prevent and control the outbreak of major diseases, increase the standard of average expenditure on basic public health services, expand the basic national public health service programme, implement major public health projects, strengthen the prevention and control of major communicable diseases as well as chronic, occupational, endemic and mental illness and enhance our capacity to respond to public health emergencies.",""],[1,"40","17","Rural Health Service Network Construction","We will gradually complete the construction of health service network in rural areas, move toward universal access to health education, implement the national health plan and make people fully aware of no smoking in public.",""],[1,"40","18","Three-Tier Rural Health Service Network Construction","we will strengthen the construction of the three tiered county, township and village health service network in rural areas.",""],[1,"41","1","Urban and Rural Medical Service System Development","urban medical service system based on the community health service, increase medical care resources in favour of rural areas and urban communities.",""],[1,"41","1","Primary Medical Care Innovation and Financing Reform","Accelerate the comprehensive innovation of primary medical care unit, set up multi-channel subsidies to facilitate a new operating mechanism.",""],[1,"41","1","Basic Medical Workforce Development and Incentives","We will build up the ranks of basic medical service staffs, with the emphasis on cultivation of the general medical practitioner, perfect the incentive policies for them to work in grassroot level, the share of the general medical practitioner will reach 0.2 per 1000 persons.",""],[1,"41","1","Graded Treatment and Two-Way Referral System","We will press forward the grading treatment and two way transfers system to create a situation in which all kinds of urban and rural medical institutions can benefit from division of labor and coordination of work.",""],[1,"41","1","Regional Health Planning and Diversified Hospital Ownership","We will improve the regional health planning, encourage and guide the nongovernmental investors to establish medical institutions in order to form a diversified hospital running system.",""]],"65":[[1,"42","2","Traditional Chinese Medicine Development and Standardization","We will attach equal importance to Traditional Chinese Medicine and Western Medicine, develop the functions of treatment and preventive health care of Traditional Chinese Medicine and advance its inheritance and innovation, we will also pay greater attention to the development of ethnic minorities medicines.",""],[1,"42","2","Traditional Medicine Institutional and Human Resource Strengthening","We will strengthen the institution construction and human resource development, strengthen the resource protection, research and exploration and reasonable utilization, push forward quality certification and standard formulation.",""],[1,"42","2","Traditional Medicine Policy Support and Essential Drugs Access","Traditional Chinese Medicine should be encouraged to provide and make use of the medical security policy and essential drugs policy.",""]],"66":[[1,"20","5","Public Sports Facilities Development and National Fitness Programme","There will be vigorous development of public sports and improvement of public sports facilities.",""],[1,"20","5","Rural Population Fitness Programme","We will continue the fitness programme for the rural population.",""],[1,"20","5","Competitive Sports Structure Optimization","We will optimise the competitive sports structure and improve the overall strength of competitive sports.",""],[1,"20","5","Sports Industry and Recreational Sports Development","We will further develop fitness and recreational sports, sports competition and performance markets, and advance sporting goods, sports agents, venue operators and other intermediary services, to promote the coordinated development of sports facilities and the sports industry.",""]],"67":[[1,"42","12","Real Estate Market Regulation Improvement","Improve the real estate market regulation",""],[1,"43","3","Local Housing Accountability and Market Supervision Reform","Further fulfil the local government's responsibility and the accountability system, bring it into the development goal of various regions that to ensure basic housing, stabilize the house price and intensify the market monitoring, provincial governments take the overall responsibility while the governments at municipal and county level take the direct responsibility.",""],[1,"43","3","Basic Housing Assurance Law and Real Estate Regulation Reform","Speed up the formulation of the basic housing assurance law, modify the urban real estate management law and relevant regulations, perfect the housing fund mechanism, reinforce the management and expand the coverage.",""],[1,"43","3","Real Estate Market Supervision and Order Standardization","Intensify the market supervision, standardize the order of the real estate market.",""],[1,"43","3","Housing Information System Development","Speed up the construction of the housing information system, improve the information publication system.",""]],"68":[[1,"44","2","Women's Development Planning and Gender Equality Policy Implementation","Insist on the basic state policies of gender equality, implement the women's development planning, secure the legal interests and rights of the women.",""],[1,"44","2","Women's Employment and Entrepreneurship Promotion","Promote the employment and entrepreneurship of the women, improve the women's capacity to contribute to economic development and social management.",""],[1,"44","2","Women's Social Protection, Health, and Legal Assistance Support","Strengthen the labor protection, social welfare, health care, poverty relief and poverty reduction, and legal assistance for women.",""],[1,"44","2","Gender Statistics System Improvement","Improve the gender statistics system, improve the development environment for women.",""],[1,"44","2","Violence Against Women and Trafficking Crackdown","Crack down the crimes of violence against women and abducting and trafficking women.",""]],"69":[[1,"44","3","Children Development Outline Implementation and Child Rights Protection","implement the Children development outline, protect children's rights to survival, development, beiing protected and the right to participation.",""],[1,"44","3","Child Welfare and Healthy Development Improvement","Improve the environment of the growth of the children, enhance the welfare of the children, eliminate the discrimination against girls, and endeavor to safeguard their healthy growth physically and psychologically.",""],[1,"44","3","Children's Basic and Social Behavior Education","Strengthen children's elementary education and social behavior education.",""],[1,"44","3","Support Measures for Left-Behind, Orphaned, Disabled, and Migrant Children","Effectively resolve some remarkable problems concerning left-behind children, orphans, disabled children and migrant children.",""],[1,"44","3","Crackdown on Child Trafficking and Abandonment","Crack down crimes such as child trafficking, abandonment, etc.",""]],"70":[[1,"44","5","Disability Social Security and Social Services Improvement","Improve the social security system and social service system for people with disabilities; provide the stable policy security protection to the life and development of people with disabilities.",""],[1,"44","5","Disability Rehabilitation and Care Services Project","Implement the focus rehabilitation and care service project, implement the urgency rescue rehabilitation project for people with disabilities between the age of 0 to 6, promote the \"everybody has rehabilitation service\".",""],[1,"44","5","Disability Employment Services and Vocational Training","Actively carry out the employment service for people with disabilities and vocational training.",""],[1,"44","5","Disability Life Care and Production Support Services","Improve the assistance and support service in life care and the production",""],[1,"45","1","National Disability Prevention Action Plan","Design and implement the national action plan of disability prevention, effectively control the occurrence and deterioration of the disability.",""],[1,"45","1","Barrier-Free Environment Development","Facilitate the barrier-free environment development.",""],[1,"45","1","Disability Inclusion in Rural Livelihoods, Culture, and Sports","work for people with disabilities in rural area. Diversify the life of people with disabilities in culture and sports aspects.",""]],"71":[[1,"30","1","Climate Change Adaptation and Extreme Weather Response","We will increase adaptability to climate change, with special attention to the reaction to extreme weather.",""],[1,"30","1","Greenhouse Gas Emissions Monitoring System","This plan will establish and improve the statistical monitoring system of greenhouse gas emissions and energy saving and emission reductions, devote more efforts to climate change research, accelerate low carbon application and research, and establish a carbon emission trading market.",""],[1,"30","1","Climate Change Research and Low-Carbon Technology Promotion","This plan will establish and improve the statistical monitoring system of greenhouse gas emissions and energy saving and emission reductions, devote more efforts to climate change research, accelerate low carbon application and research, and establish a carbon emission trading market.",""],[1,"30","1","Carbon Emissions Trading Market","This plan will establish and improve the statistical monitoring system of greenhouse gas emissions and energy saving and emission reductions, devote more efforts to climate change research, accelerate low carbon application and research, and establish a carbon emission trading market.",""],[1,"30","1","International Climate Cooperation Initiative","it will persist in common but differentiated principles of liability and vigorously launch international cooperation in response to global climate change.",""],[1,"30","2","Climate Change Response Capacity and Policy System Improvement","we must perfect system mechanisms and policy systems and improve our capacity for dealing with climate change.",""],[1,"30","3","Industrial and Resource Structure Adjustment for Low-Carbon Development","We must carry out comprehensive adjustments to the composition of the industrial and resource structures, save energy and improve energy efficiency and increase forest carbon sinks, amongst several other measures.",""],[1,"30","3","Greenhouse Gas Emissions Regulation and Energy Consumption Control","We must significantly reduce the intensity of our energy consumption and CO2 emissions, as well as effectively regulate greenhouse gas (GHG) emissions.",""],[1,"30","3","Resource Development Planning and Regulatory Mechanism","We must rationally regulate our total energy consumption levels, carry out serious management of resource usage, accelerate the formulation of resource development plans, clarify total regulatory targets and define a workable mechanism.",""],[1,"30","3","National Tree Planting and Afforestation Programme","We will promote the planting of trees and forestation to increase the national forest-cover area to 12.5 million hectares.",""],[1,"30","3","Low-Carbon Technology Research, Development and Application Programme","We will accelerate research, development and application of low carbon technologies and regulate GHG emitting sectors such as industry, construction, transportation and agriculture.",""],[1,"30","3","Low-Carbon Standards, Emissions Accounting and Carbon Trading System","We will look into creating low carbon product standardisation, labelling and authentication systems, establish an effective system for calculating GHG emission statistics and gradually create a carbon emissions trading system.",""],[1,"30","3","Low-Carbon Pilot Projects","We will advance low carbon pilot projects.",""],[1,"30","4","National Climate Change Strategy","We will formulate an overall national strategy for combating climate change and strengthen our scientific research and observation to influence our analysis of climate change.",""],[1,"30","4","Climate Adaptation and Disaster Preparedness Capacity Building","By strengthening our response to climate change, we mean creating a capacity to cope with extreme climate incidents; accelerating and expanding technological research and development; and improving the levels of adaptation to climate change of certain key sectors (such as agriculture, forestry and water resources) and certain areas (such as by the coast and fragile ecosystems).",""],[1,"30","4","Extreme Weather Monitoring and Disaster Prevention System","We must enhance monitoring, advance reporting and prevention of extreme weather and climate incidents, and we must improve our capacity to guard against and alleviate natural disasters.",""],[1,"30","5","International Climate Negotiation Participation and Cooperation","we will actively participate in international negotiations and promote the establishment of a",""],[1,"31","1","International Climate Cooperation and Technology Transfer Platform","We will strengthen international exchange and strategic policy dialogue on climate change.",""]],"72":[[1,"31","12","Resource Conservation and Controlled Use Strategy","We will emphasize resource conservation and management.",""],[1,"31","12","Energy and Mineral Resource Survey and Reserve System","We will reinforce the geological survey of energy and mineral resource conservation while legitimately developing and integrating strategic areas for energy and mineral resources, and installing critical mineral resource reserve systems.",""],[1,"31","12","Land Management System Improvement","Land management systems should be further improved.",""],[1,"31","12","Water Resource Allocation and Management System","We will pay adequate attention to water safety in order to build a water-saving society by setting up water resource allocation systems and enhancing water resource management and paid utilization.",""],[1,"31","12","Desalination Technology Promotion","Desalination technology should be highly encouraged.",""],[1,"31","12","Groundwater Extraction Restriction","Groundwater exploitation should be rigorously restricted.",""]],"73":[[1,"4","10","Macro-Control Strengthening and Policy Coordination","Strengthen and improve macro-control.",""],[1,"53","9","Cross-Border Financial Regulation and Supervision Reform","Establish cross-boarder, cross-market financial regulation rules.",""],[1,"53","9","Enhanced Supervision of Systemically Important Financial Institutions","Strengthen supervision on the systemically important financial institutions (SIFIs).",""],[1,"53","9","Participation in International Financial Standards Amendment","Participate in the amendment to international financial standards.",""]],"74":[[1,"51","1","Public Security System Establishment","Push forward the establishment of a public security system that combines proactive prevention and control and emergency response, and integrates traditional and modern approaches.",""],[1,"51","5","Social Public Order Control System Improvement","Improve social public order control system",""],[1,"51","6","National Population Basic Information Database","Establish a national basic information database of population.",""],[1,"51","6","Support Services for Special Population Groups","Strengthen settlement, relief, help, education, management and medical assistance for special groups of the population;",""],[1,"51","6","Public Security Rectification and Rapid Response Capacity Enhancement","strengthen rectification on the weak links and key areas of public security.",""],[1,"51","6","Public Security Intelligence and Rapid Reaction Capacity Upgrade","Enhance intelligence information, prevention and control, and rapid reaction capabilities, improve the ability to ensure public security and social order.",""]],"75":[[1,"53","5","Second Board Launch Enhancement","Improve the launch of the second board.",""],[1,"53","5","STARS Pilot Expansion","Expend the scope of the STARS pilots.",""],[1,"53","5","Over-the-Counter Market Development","Promote the development of the Over the Counter Market.",""],[1,"53","5","International Board Feasibility Exploration","Explore the possibility of launching the international board.",""],[1,"53","5","Asset Securitization Advancement","Move forward with asset securitization.",""]],"76":[[1,"26","5","Rural-to-Urban Resident Conversion Policy","Steadily promote the rural residents becoming urban residents.",""],[1,"26","5","Urban Population Management and Hukou Reform","Mega cities should control its population scale, big and medium cities should strengthen and improve population management, attract more population, small and medium cities and counties should encourage relax their conditions of Hukou.",""],[1,"26","5","Migrant Worker Public Service and Rights Protection","Meanwhile, public service and interest protection should be strengthened for migrant workers who don't have the qualification to have a city Hukou.",""],[1,"27","4","Urban Hukou Reform and Migrant Integration Measures","By keeping on the method of providing treatment in accordance with local conditions and pushing forward the progress step by step, to transform immigrant workers that have established stable labour relationship and have worked in the town for certain years into town citizens.",""],[1,"27","4","Differentiated Urban Population Management","In super large cities, the population should be controlled rationally.",""],[1,"27","4","Strengthened Population Management in Large and Medium Cities","In large and middle sized cities, the population management should be strengthened and improved, so as to keep on exerting the important role of absorbing migrant population.",""],[1,"27","4","Expanded Population Transformation Conditions in Small Cities and Towns","In middle and small cities as well as small towns, the conditions of population transformation should be broadened according to the real situation.",""],[1,"27","4","Local Pilot Policies for Population Transformation","Encouraging different areas or districts to explore related policies and measures, so as to define the scale of the population being transformed.",""],[1,"27","5","Migrant Worker Public Services and Rights Protection","the public service to them should be improved and the rights protections should be strengthened.",""],[1,"27","5","Equal Compulsory Education for Migrant Workers' Children","Children of migrant workers should enjoy the equal rights to compulsory education, and the continuity or connection between middle school and high school should be well handled.",""],[1,"28","1","Migrant Worker Social Protection and Housing Support Measures","labour relationship with enterprises should be included into the basic retirement insurance and medical insurance of township workers.",""],[1,"28","1","Migrant Worker Training Allowance and Provincial Coordination Mechanism","Establishing basic training and allowance systems for migrant workers, pushing forward the general coordination in provincial level regarding the capital management for the trainings of migrant workers.",""],[1,"28","1","Migrant Worker Housing Improvement and Inclusion in Urban Housing Guarantees","Improving the residential conditions of migrant workers through multi- channels and multi-formalities, encouraging bringing qualified migrant workers into the housing guarantee systems of the towns by adopting various methods",""]],"77":[[1,"41","2","Basic Medical Insurance System Improvement","We will improve the basic medical insurance system covering urban and rural residents, promote the development of basic medical insurance systems for urban workers and residents, new type of cooperative medical care system in rural areas and medical assistance.",""],[1,"41","2","Medical Insurance System Integration and Remote Settlement Reform","We will work out methods for connecting each system, integrate resources and raise the level of management step by setp, realize the transformation and continuity of the medical insurance and remote settlement of expenses for medical treatment.",""],[1,"41","2","Immediate Settlement and Payment Innovation for Medical Expenses","We will promote immediate settlement of basic medical expenses and innovate the means of payment.",""],[1,"41","2","Commercial Medical Insurance Development","Commercial medical insurance will be actively developed the as a supplementary to the medical insurance system.",""],[1,"45","6","Medical Care Benefit Expansion","Increase the medical care benefit level",""],[1,"46","1","Expansion of Basic Medical Insurance Coverage","Increase the number of urban and rural residents newly enrolled in the basic medical insurance scheme by 60 million people.",""],[1,"46","1","Increased Fiscal Subsidies for Medical Insurance Schemes","Steadily increase the level of subsidies from fiscal budget to the basic medical insurance scheme and the new countryside cooperative medical scheme; the percentage of payment covered by the medical insurance fund within policy scope to increase to over 70%.",""]],"78":[[1,"3","2","Balanced Urban-Rural Development and Urbanization Drive","striking a balance between the urban and rural development, proactively and steadily put forward the urbanization, accelerating the construction of socialist new villages and achieving the coordinated and interactive development among areas",""],[1,"4","11","Urbanization Acceleration Strategy","Create positive consumption environment by actively yet steadily accelerating urbanization,",""]],"79":[[1,"53","7","Market-Based Managed Floating Exchange Rate Reform","Improve the market-based managed floating exchange rate regime.",""],[1,"53","7","Foreign Exchange Management System Reform","Press ahead with the reform of the foreign exchange management system.",""],[1,"53","7","Cross-Border Yuan Trade Expansion","Expend the scope of cross- border yuan trade.",""],[1,"53","7","RMB Capital Account Convertibility Reform","Push forward RMB capital account convertibility.",""],[1,"53","7","Foreign Exchange Reserve Management Improvement","Improve the management of foreign exchange reserve, expend the scale and increase the yields.",""]],"80":[[1,"21","5","Western Region Large-Scale Development Initiative","Promoting a new round of large scale of development of the western region.",""],[1,"22","2","Western Regional Development Support Measures","Adhere to the depth of the western development strategy on priority of overall regional development strategy, and to give special policy supports.",""],[1,"22","2","Western Infrastructure Expansion Programme","Strengthen infrastructural construction, expand network of railways, civil aviation, water transportation, build a number of key water main water hydro station, accelerate to push forward the oil and gas pipelines and main electricity transmission and networks projects.",""],[1,"22","2","Resource Development and Deep Processing Strategy","Take advantage of resources, implement market-oriented advantage resources transmission strategy, arrange a number of resource development and deep processing projects in the resource-rich regions, build continuous places of national important energy and strategic resources and industries gathering areas, develop advantage industries such as characteristic agriculture and tourism.",""],[1,"22","2","Science and Education Development Support","Vigorously develop science and education, enhance self-development.",""],[1,"22","2","Disaster Area Recovery Support","Support the development of Wenchuan and other disaster areas.",""],[1,"22","2","Regional Cooperation and Growth Pole Development","Adhere to stringing points with line and driving area with point, promote Chongqing, Chengdu, Xi'an regional strategic cooperation, promote development of economic zones such as Hohhot Baotou Bao Hubei Yu, Guangzi North Bay, Chengdu Chongqing, middle area of Guizhou, middle area of Yunnan, middle south area of Tibet, Guanzhong-Tianshui, Lanzhou-Xining, Ningxia along Huangshan and Tianshan mountains, foster new economic growth points.",""],[1,"23","5","Western Region Infrastructure and Public Services Improvement","Further increase the supports efforts, strengthen infrastructural construction, strengthen ecological protection and restoration, improve public services, and practically improve the living conditions in the western region.",""]],"81":[[1,"21","7","Central Region Development Acceleration","Vigorously accelerate the rise of central region.",""],[1,"21","7","National Grain Production Base Consolidation","Consolidate the national important grain production base",""],[1,"21","7","Energy and Raw Material Base Development","Consolidate the national important grain production base, energy and raw material base",""],[1,"21","7","Modern Equipment Manufacturing Development","build modern equipment manufacturing",""],[1,"21","7","Comprehensive Transportation Center Development","build modern equipment manufacturing and comprehensive transportation center.",""],[1,"21","7","Industrial and Population Agglomeration Promotion","Promote the agglomeration of industry and population",""],[1,"21","7","Urban-Rural and City-Chain Connectivity Strengthening","strengthen the connection with surrounded city chain.",""]],"82":[[1,"34","1","Livelihood Improvement and Basic Public Services Equalization","Take people's livelihood as a priority; improve employment, income distribution, social security, medical services and housing security to ensure and improve people's livelihood; advance equalisation of basic public services; and strive to share the fruits of China's development to benefit all Chinese people.",""],[1,"34","2","Basic Public Services Equalization and Welfare System Improvement","Perfect the system arrangement on employment, income distribution, health and medical care, and housing etc. to ensure and improve people's wellbeing.",""],[1,"34","2","Equalization of Basic Public Services","Facilitate the equalization of basic public service.",""],[1,"34","3","Urban-Rural Basic Public Services Equalization","enhance the government's support capabilities, and gradually narrow the gap in basic public services between urban and rural areas.",""],[1,"34","4","Basic Public Service System Reform","Establish and improve the basic public service system",""],[1,"35","5","Public Service Delivery Reform and Competition Mechanism","Reform the ways of supplying basic public service, introduce a mechanism of competition ...",""],[1,"35","6","Market-Oriented Reform of Non-Basic Public Services","Promote the market-oriented reform of non-basic public service, further open up market access, encourage participation of social capital by various means ...",""],[1,"35","7","Public Service Capacity Improvement and Urban-Rural Service Gap Reduction","Discharge the government's public service duty, improve the maintaining ability of government.",""],[1,"35","7","Basic Public Service Equalization Initiative","Gradually narrow the basic public service gap between urban and rural areas.",""],[1,"35","8","Basic Public Service Standards and Performance Accountability Reform","Clearly define the areas and standards of basic public service, facilitate the improvement of public finance system, secure the expenditure on basic public service, and strengthen the system of performance evaluation and administrative accountability of basic public service.",""],[1,"35","8","Central-Local Public Service Governance Reform","Reasonably divide the management power of central and local governments.",""],[1,"35","8","Local-Led Public Service Management System","Improve the public service management system, which is led by local government and combines centralization and localization.",""],[1,"36","2","Basic Public Service Provision Reform","Reform the provision methods of basic public service, introduce the competition mechanism, increase the amount of purchased service, and diversify the types of service providers and service provision methods.",""],[1,"36","2","Market-Oriented Reform of Non-Basic Public Services","Facilitate the market-oriented reform in the field of non-basic public service, widen the market access, encourage the participation of social capital through various channels, strengthen the multi-level provision abilities, and meet the diversified demand of the people.",""],[1,"61","1","Market Environment and Industrial Regulation Reform","Government at all levels should create a sound policy, system and legal environment, break down market segmentation and industry monopoly, stimulate initiative and creativity of market players, steer the behaviour of market players towards national strategic objectives.",""],[1,"61","2","Basic Public Services Equalization Implementation Framework","The tasks on promoting equalisation of basic public services should be achieved mainly by utilisation of public resources by the government, with clearly defined work responsibilities and planned schedule.",""],[1,"61","4","Optimization of Fiscal Expenditure and Government Investment","Optimise the structure of fiscal expenditure and government investment, steadily increase the central government's investment scale, with focus on people's livelihood and social causes, agriculture and rural areas, science technology and innovation, ecology and environmental protection and resources conservation, and with a bigger proportion devoted to the middle and western regions, former revolutionary base areas, areas inhabited by minority ethnic groups, remote and border areas and poverty-stricken areas.",""]],"83":[[1,"48","9","Emergency Response Capacity Building","put more focus on building emergency response capacity, effectively addressing and properly handling unexpected public incidents",""],[1,"50","8","Food and Drug Safety Safeguarding Measure","Safeguard the security of food and drugs",""],[1,"50","10","Emergency Response System Improvement","3. Improve the emergency responding system",""],[1,"51","4","Emergency Response System Improvement","Improve emergency response system",""]],"84":[[1,"3","4","Social Welfare System Improvement","improving social welfare system",""],[1,"3","4","Equal Public Services Provision","providing equal public services to every citizen",""],[1,"5","5","Basic Public Service Equalization Initiative","Promote the equalization of basic public service.",""],[1,"5","5","Social Security System Reform","Improve public fiscal system and the social security system",""]],"85":[[1,"3","6","Open-Up Strategy Implementation","We should carry out the open-up strategy to achieve outcomes.",""]],"86":[[1,"10","6","Biological Resource Database Development","Build databases of gene resources for pharmaceuticals, important plants and animals, and industrial microbial bacteria.",""],[1,"10","6","Biopharmaceutical and Biomedical Engineering R&D Bases","Construct R&D and industrialization bases for biopharmaceuticals and biomedical engineering products, biological breeding, testing, detection and fine breeding bases, and exemplary bio-manufacturing application platforms.",""]],"87":[[1,"3","5","Resource-Saving and Environment-Friendly Society Development","the importance of building a resource-saving and environment-friendly society should be stressed to save energy, reduce greenhouse emissions and actively tackle global climate change.",""],[1,"3","5","Circular Economy and Low-Carbon Technology Development","We should develop circular economy and low carbon technologies",""],[1,"5","4","Energy Conservation and Emission Reduction Incentive Reform","Improve the incentive mechanism of energy conservation and emission reduction.",""]],"88":[[1,"10","4","Major Demonstration Projects for Energy Conservation and Environmental Protection","Implement major exemplary projects in energy conservation and environmental protection, and promote the industrialization of efficient energy conservation, advanced environmental protection and resource recycling.",""]],"89":[[1,"12","4","Strategic Energy Transmission Channel Construction","Accelerate the construction of the strategic transmission channels for northwestern, northeastern, southwestern China and sea-imported oil and gas, and improve the domestic trunk oil and gas pipe network.",""],[1,"12","4","Natural Gas Import and Transmission Network Planning","Make unified planning of natural gas import pipelines, LNG receiving stations, and cross-regional trunk gas transmission and distribution networks, and create a gas supply layout in which natural gas, coal-bed gas and coal-based gas are balanced.",""],[1,"12","4","Modern Power Grid Expansion and Upgrade","Accelerate the building of a modern power grid system, further expand the size of west-to-east power transmission, improve regional trunk power grids, and develop advanced large-capacity, high- efficiency and long-distance power transmission technologies to meet requirements for large-scale cross-regional power transmission and the grid connection of new energy generated power.",""],[1,"12","4","Smart Grid and Rural Power Network Improvement","Promote the construction of intelligent power grids, strengthen urban and rural power grid construction and improvement, and improve the electric performance and supply reliability of power grids using advanced information, control and energy storage technologies.",""],[1,"13","2","Construction of Major Oil and Gas Transmission Pipelines","Construct the China-Kazakhstan crude oil pipeline (Phase 2), the China-Myanmar oil and gas pipeline (domestic section), the Central Asia natural gas pipeline (Phase 2), and the West-to-east Gas Transmission Lines 3 and 4.",""],[1,"13","2","Gas Storage Facility Expansion","Accelerate the construction of gas storage facilities.",""]],"90":[[1,"3","6","Economic, Political and Social Reform Agenda","We should unswervingly push forward reforms in economic, political and social areas.",""],[1,"4","12","Investment Structure Optimization and Private Investment Promotion","optimize investment structure.",""],[1,"5","5","Public Fiscal System Reform","Improve public fiscal system",""],[1,"5","7","Social Management Strengthening and Innovation","Strengthen and innovate social management.",""]],"91":[[1,"3","6","International Cooperation on Global Challenges","We are working with the international society to tackling global challenges and share the potential for development.",""]],"92":[[1,"16","7","IT Infrastructure and E-Business Development","Promote IT building in all socioeconomic fields.",""],[1,"16","7","SME-Oriented E-Business Services Improvement","Develop e-business actively, improve e-business services oriented to SMEs, and promote the construction of society-oriented credit services, online payment and logistic distribution systems.",""],[1,"16","7","Society-Oriented Credit, Online Payment, and Logistics Systems","promote the construction of society-oriented credit services, online payment and logistic distribution systems.",""]],"93":[[1,"18","7","Modern Logistics System Development","We will accelerate the establishment of social, professional, information-based modern logistics system, vigorously develop third-party logistics, prioritise the integration and use of existing logistics resources, support the construction and linking-up of the logistics infrastructure, improve logistics efficiency and reduce logistics costs.",""],[1,"19","1","Regional Distribution System Optimization","We will optimize the development of regional distribution systems, and support the orderly development of logistics parks and other cluster areas of logistics.",""],[1,"19","1","Logistics Park and Cluster Area Development","We will optimize the development of regional distribution systems, and support the orderly development of logistics parks and other cluster areas of logistics.",""],[1,"19","1","Modern Logistics Management Development","We will promote the development of modern logistics management, and improve the sophistication and standardization of logistics.",""],[1,"19","8","Urban and Rural Commercial Distribution Network Optimization","Optimization of urban supermarkets, shopping malls, wholesale markets and other business outlets structure and distribution will be driven forward.",""],[1,"19","8","Support for Convenience Stores and Local Food Retail Projects","We will endorse convenience stores, small supermarkets, local food stores and related local development projects.",""],[1,"19","8","Modern Distribution and Rural Service Network Expansion","We will encourage and support chain operations, logistics, e- commerce and other modern methods of distribution extending to rural areas, we will also improve rural services networks, support links between large-scale supermarkets with rural cooperation organisations, and reform and upgrade agricultural wholesale markets and farmers markets.",""],[1,"19","8","Regulatory Improvement for Accommodation and Catering","We will guide the development of healthy regulations in the accommodation and catering industry",""],[1,"19","8","Development of Large-Scale Trade and Business Enterprises","support the development of internationally competitive large-scale trade and business enterprises.",""],[1,"20","8","Logistics Institutional Reform","We will deepen organisations and institutions logistics related social reform.",""]],"94":[[1,"20","3","Domestic Services Development and Market Standardization","we will focus on the development of house-keeping services, pension services, nursing services and similar services.",""]],"95":[[1,"21","9","Support for Development of Disadvantaged Border and Minority Areas","Greater support to the development of old revolutionary base areas, ethnic minority areas and border areas.",""],[1,"23","5","Support for Old Revolutionary Base Area Development","Continue to implement policy to support the development of old revolutionary base areas.",""],[1,"23","5","Minority Nationality Region Development Support Policy","Implementation policies to support development of minority nationality regions, vigorously promote Tibet, Xinjiang and other minority nationality regions, give aid to development of small population nationalities.",""],[1,"23","5","Border Area Development and Border Trade Support Action","Further push forward the action of booming the border area and enriching the people, inland border areas enjoy the Western Development policies, support border trade and development of ethnical urgently needed commodities.",""],[1,"23","5","Targeted Poverty Alleviation and Industrial Relocation Projects","In the southern region, the eastern margin of Qinghai- Tibet plateau , Wuling mountains, Wumengshan mountains, western Yunnan mountains border, Qinbashan-Liupanshan mountains and other special poverty middle western areas, implement poverty alleviation and development projects, increase the efforts of pursuing poverty alleviation by development of industry and ex situ relocation.",""],[1,"24","1","Follow-up Development of the Three Gorges Reservoir Area","Promote the follow-up development of the Three Gorges reservoir area.",""],[1,"24","1","Public Welfare Project Funding Relief for Priority Areas","To the public welfare projects that the Central arranged for the 'Old, Minority, Border, Poverty' areas, cancel the county level and gradually reduce the municipal matching funds.",""],[1,"24","1","Regional Mutual Aid and One-for-One Support Policy","Implement regional mutual aid policy, carry over various one-for-one support.",""]],"96":[[1,"22","1","Regional Cooperation and Factor Mobility Promotion","Give full play to comparative advantages in different areas, and promote the rational flow of factors of production, deepening regional cooperation and promote the development of regional interaction, and gradually narrow the development gap between regions.",""]],"97":[[1,"26","6","Urban Construction Financing Reform and Municipal Bond Issuance","Deepening the investment and financing reform of city construction, issue bonds for city construction.",""],[1,"26","6","Township Construction Standardization and Urban Density Optimization","Standardize the construction of new township, increase the density, optimize the landing using structure, and prevent the overall expanding of mega cities.",""],[1,"26","6","Comprehensive Urban and County Management Strengthening","Strengthen comprehensive management.",""],[1,"28","3","Urban Planning and City Construction Standards Reform","scientifically working out the city plan, perfecting standards of city construction, strengthening the sanction effects of the city plan.",""],[1,"28","3","Urban Growth Boundary and New Town Regulation","Rationally define the borders of the city development, regulating the construction of the new towns and districts, enhancing the population density of the newly constructed districts, adjusting and optimising the using structures of lands used for construction projects, preventing the over expansion of super large cities.",""],[1,"28","3","Urban Disease Prevention and Remediation Measures","Preventing and curing the \"city disease\".",""],[1,"28","4","Construction Market Supervision and Standardization","Strengthening the supervision of the construction markets, standardizing orders of the construction markets.",""],[1,"28","4","Urban Construction Investment and Financing Reform","Deepening the reform on investment and financing systems of city construction, issuing bonds of city construction projects.",""],[1,"28","4","Urban Comprehensive Management Improvement","Strengthening comprehensive management of cities.",""]],"98":[[1,"28","4","Urban Public Facilities and Infrastructure Construction","Overall planning the construction of public facilities in both up-ground and under- ground lands, comprehensively increasing the levels of transportation, telecommunication, electric power, heating, gas, drainage, waste water and garbage disposal infrastructures, and increasing the disaster prevention capacity.",""],[1,"28","4","Urban Green Space and Public Amenities Expansion","Enlarging green areas and public exercising spaces of cities, speeding up the construction of public culture and sports facilities.",""],[1,"28","4","Urban Village and Rurban Reconstruction","Pushing forward the reconstruction of the city villages and rurbans.",""],[1,"28","4","Digital City Development Programme","Pushing forward the construction of digital cities, enhancing the service levels on informationalization and subtlization.",""],[1,"28","4","Urban Cultural Heritage Protection and Humanistic Environment Improvement","Attaching importance to culture continuity and protection, and improving humanistic environments of cities.",""]],"99":[[1,"23","3","Resource Efficiency and Environmental Pollution Control","Focus on enhancing sustainably development capacity, further improve resource usage efficiency of energy, land, and sea, strengthen environmental pollution regulation, and resolve the bottleneck problem of resource and environment.",""],[1,"32","10","Pollutant Emissions Reduction and Management","Unit One: Enhance the reduction and administration of pollutant emissions",""],[1,"32","10","Environmental Risk Precaution Measures","Unit Two: Take precautions on environment risks",""],[1,"32","10","Environmental Supervision Strengthening","Unit Three: Enhance environmental supervision",""],[1,"32","12","Waste Treatment Facilities Construction","The construction of waste (sewage and rubbish) treatment facilities",""],[1,"32","16","Pollution Control and Environmental Governance Strengthening","We will enhance comprehensive governance and improve the environment.",""],[1,"33","1","Polluter-Pays Environmental Policy System","Coordinate environmental protection technology and economic policy and set up a polluter-pays system.",""],[1,"33","1","Diversified Financing for Environmental Industries","Diversified financing mechanisms should be well-established to further develop environmental industries.",""]],"100":[[1,"34","6","Free Employment Services and Labour Mediation","provide employment info, consultation, referral, labour mediation and arbitration services to urban and rural labourers free of charge;",""],[1,"34","6","Free Basic Vocational Training Programme","provide basic vocational training free of charge to unemployed people, rural migrant workers, the disabled people, and new labourers;",""],[1,"36","9","Vocational Training System Development","Set up a vocational training system that",""],[1,"37","1","Vocational Training Capacity Expansion","Increase the vocational training capacity and level.",""],[1,"37","1","Self-Employment Training Programme","Enhance self- employment training.",""]],"101":[[1,"34","6","Employment Assistance for Vulnerable Jobseekers","provide employment assistance to people with employment difficulties and zero- employment families.",""],[1,"36","3","Employment Promotion and Full Employment Mechanism","Take promotion of employment as a priority for economic and social development; improve the mechanism to combine self-selection of jobs by labourers, employment regulation by market and employment promotion by government; create equal employment opportunities; improve employment quality and strive to achieve full employment.",""],[1,"36","4","Active Employment Policy Reform","Adopt more active employment policies",""],[1,"36","5","Public Employment Service Strengthening","Strengthen public employment service",""],[1,"36","7","Integrated Employment Promotion Mechanism","Promotion of employment will be highly prioritized at the economic and social development agenda, reinforce an integrated mechanism of independent job-choosing, market-regulated employment and government led employment, create equal job opportunities, raise the job quality and promote full employment.",""],[1,"36","8","Employment Promotion and Job Creation Measures","Develop labor-intense and service industry as well as small and micro size service industry, adopt all possible measures to enlarge employment rate.",""],[1,"36","8","Employment-Friendly Incentives and Support Policies","Establish employment-friendly policies, such as tax-reduction, job allowance, vocational training allowance, social security allowance, etc, strengthen employment of graduates, migrant workers, and people with difficulty in urban areas.",""],[1,"36","8","Self-Employment and Micro-Credit Support","Encourage self- employment with a better developed micro-credit fund, financial allowance and in terms of operational space, and so on.",""],[1,"36","8","Employment Promotion in Government-Invested Projects","Improve a system that promotes employment throughout big government-invested projects.",""],[1,"36","8","Employment Aid Policy and Public-Interest Job Creation","Develop employment aid policy; create more public-interest jobs via various channels.",""],[1,"36","8","International Labor Cooperation Promotion","Encourage international labor cooperation.",""],[1,"36","9","Unified National Human Resource Market Reform","Promote unified, regulated and flexible Human Resource market, improve rural and urban employment service system, and realize a nation-wide employment information database to provide quality service to laborer.",""]],"102":[[1,"37","1","Unemployment Statistics Capacity Development","Develop unemployment statistic ability in both rural and urban areas.",""],[1,"37","1","Unemployment Monitoring and Early Warning System","Establish an unemployment monitoring and early warning system, and start with employment needs forecast.",""]],"103":[[1,"37","2","Tripartite Labor Relations Coordination Mechanism","Coordinate the three-party labor relation, promote the full potential of government, labor union and enterprise in terms of shaping a benefit sharing system between enterprises and employees.",""],[1,"37","2","Labor Contract System Expansion","Push for labor contract system in a comprehensive way and to a larger scale.",""],[1,"37","2","Labor Law Enforcement and Dispute Resolution Strengthening","Strengthen the labor law enforcement, develop the mechanism of labor dispute settlement, improve labor dispute mediation and arbitration, intensify labor security supervision and law enforcement efforts to ensure the interests of workers.",""]],"104":[[1,"45","7","Minimum Living Allowance Increase","Increase the minimum living allowance level in both rural and urban areas",""],[1,"45","9","Tax Burden Reduction for Residents","Lighten the taxation burden of the resident",""],[1,"46","4","Personal Income Tax Reform","Increase the personal income and wage tax deduction threshold, and reasonably adjust the tax rate structure for personal income tax in the early phase of the 12th Five-Year period; establish and improve the personal income tax system featuring combination of integration and classification in the middle and late phase of the 12th Five-Year period.",""]],"105":[[1,"49","11","Social Organization Development and Function Transfer Reform","Foster the development of social organizations.",""],[1,"49","12","Social Organization Supervision and Management Strengthening","Strengthen the supervision and management of social organization.",""],[1,"49","13","Social Organization Development and Supervision Framework","Attach equal importance to cultivation, development, management and supervision; promote healthy and orderly development of social organisations; bring into play their functions of providing services, reflecting appeals and standardising behaviour.",""],[1,"49","14","Social Organizations Development Promotion","Promote development of social organisations",""],[1,"49","15","Development of Social Organizations and Industry Associations","Prioritise development of economic, public charity, urban and rural community social organisations; promote reform and development of industry associations and chambers of commerce.",""],[1,"50","1","Strengthen Supervision of Social Organizations","Strengthen supervision of social organisations",""],[1,"58","1","Civil Organization Support and Mobilization","Promote the unions, the communist youth league's, the women's federation and other civil organizations.",""],[1,"58","5","Support for People's Organizations in Social Management and Public Services","Support trade unions, Communist Youth League, women's federation and other people's organisations to undertake work according to law and their respective charters, and participate in social management and public services.",""]],"106":[[1,"48","8","Public Communication, Consultation, and Grievance Resolution Mechanism","put more focus on equal communication and consultation, addressing lawful and reasonable appeals from the public, timely resolving social conflicts.",""],[1,"50","2","Public Consultation and Petition System Improvement","Improve the public hearing and expert consultation system of public decision-making process.",""],[1,"50","5","Public Participation and Opinion Feedback Mechanism","Improve the system of keeping the public informed and undertaking public hearings, expert consultation and debate during the public decision-making process; expand public participation.",""],[1,"50","5","Petition Work and Public Feedback Mechanism","Improve the mechanism for petition work, pay attention to collection of public opinion and information feedback, effectively implement the system of officials receiving visits and handling letters from the public.",""],[1,"50","5","Social Interest Expression Channels Expansion","Bring into play the function of public organisations, industry associations and the media to express social interests; bring into play the role of the internet as a new channel for reflecting social conditions and expressing public opinion; actively and proactively respond to social concerns.",""],[1,"50","7","Mass Work System and Grassroots Social Mobilization","Improve the mass work system; rely on grass-root Party organisations, industry management organisations and people's self-governance organisations, full into full play the functions of trade unions, Communist Youth League and women's federation, join forces to safeguard the rights and interests of the people, take into account public concerns from all aspects, and actively resolve social conflicts.",""],[1,"52","4","Broad-Based Public Consultation on Major Policy Decisions","Solicit opinions on a extensive basis with regard to major policy decisions concerning the overall economic and social development.",""]],"107":[[1,"50","3","Social Contradictions Mediation Mechanism Improvement","Improve the meditation mechanism to social contradictions.",""],[1,"50","3","Major Project and Policy Risk Evaluation System","Establish the risk evaluation system for major projects and major policies.",""],[1,"50","4","People's Rights and Interests Safeguarding Mechanism","Strengthen and improve a mechanism to safeguard the people's rights and interests with the Party and the government playing a leading role; form scientific and effective mechanisms of interest coordination, expression of interest appeals, conflict conciliation, and rights protection; effectively safeguard the lawful rights and interests of the people.",""],[1,"50","6","Social Conflict Mediation Mechanism Improvement","Improve the mechanism for social conflicts mediation",""],[1,"50","7","Social Conflict Prevention and Resolution Mechanism","Improve the leadership and coordination, screening and fore-warning, counselling, mediation and handling mechanisms to resolve social conflicts.",""],[1,"50","7","Joint Public, Administrative, and Judicial Mediation Action","Strengthen the joint action of public, administrative and judicial mediation; join various forces to effectively prevent and resolve social conflicts arising from labour disputes, land expropriation and house demolition, environmental protection, food and drug safety, business restructuring and bankruptcy.",""],[1,"50","7","Social Stability Risk Assessment Mechanism for Major Projects and Policies","Establish a social stability risk assessment mechanism for key projects and major policy formulation.",""]],"108":[[1,"52","6","Public Institution Reform in Science, Education, Culture, Health and Sports","Promote the reform of public institutions in the field of science and technology, education, culture, public health and sports.",""],[1,"52","6","Legal Person Governance Reform for Transformed Public Enterprises","Establish a sound legal person governance structure in the enterprises transformed from public intuitions.",""]],"109":[[1,"52","9","Intergovernmental Financial Administration Reform","financial administration among government at all levels shall be further organized.",""],[1,"52","9","Transfer Payments System Improvement","Improve transfer payments system, and increase the scope and proportion of general transfer payments, esp. equalization transfer payments.",""],[1,"52","9","County-Level Basic Financial Service Guarantee","Strengthen guaranteed basic supply of financial service by government at county level.",""],[1,"52","9","Local Government Debt Management System","Establish a sound local government debt management system and explore the possibility of issuing local government bonds.",""]],"110":[[1,"52","11","Public Finance Budget Reform","Improve public finance budgets.",""],[1,"52","11","Government Managed Funds Budget Detailing","Make budgets for government managed funds more detailed.",""],[1,"52","11","State Capital Operations Budget Framework","Establish a sound budget for the state capital operations.",""],[1,"52","11","Budget Implementation System Improvement","Improve budget implementation system.",""]],"111":[[1,"53","10","Resource Product Pricing Mechanism Reform","Develop a sound, flexible mechanism for setting prices for resource products capable of reflecting supply and demand in the market, resource scarcity, and the cost of environmental damage.",""],[1,"53","11","Resource Product Pricing Mechanism Reform","Improve the mechanism for setting prices for resource products",""],[1,"53","12","Progressive Household Utility Pricing Reform","Press ahead with progressive pricing for household electricity and water consumption.",""],[1,"53","12","Natural Gas Pricing Adjustment","Make the price ratio of natural gas to alternative energy sources more reasonable.",""],[1,"53","13","Environmental Protection Charges Reform","Carry forward the reform of environmental protection charges",""],[1,"54","1","Resource Property Rights Exchange Mechanism","Establish a sound resource property rights exchange mechanism",""]],"112":[[1,"57","2","International Exchange and Cooperation Expansion","China is to expand exchange and cooperation with developed countries to obtain an increase of mutual trust and a higher level of cooperation.",""],[1,"57","2","Neighbourhood Friendship and Pragmatic Cooperation Deepening","In order to maintain peace and stability and to promote prosperity and development in the region friendly relationships and pragmatic cooperation with neighbouring countries will be deepened, as well as Unity and cooperation with developing countries will be enhanced and traditional friendship and common interests will be maintained.",""],[1,"57","2","Multilateral Cooperation Development","Multilateral cooperation will be developed actively.",""],[1,"57","3","International Economic System Reform","China will push for a reform of the international economic system and promote the international economic order to develop in a more fair and reasonable direction.",""],[1,"57","3","G20 Global Economic Governance Participation","China will participate actively in the G20's global economic management cooperation in order to promote and build a balanced, commonly beneficial \"win-win\" situation of the multilateral trade system.",""],[1,"57","3","International Financial System Reform","China will actively promote a reform of the international financial system and to rationalize the international currency system.",""],[1,"57","3","Macroeconomic Policy Coordination","Coordination with the major economic bodies' macro economic policies will be strengthened.",""],[1,"57","3","Participation in Drafting and Amending International Rules and Standards","China will actively take part in the drafting and amending of the international regulations and standards to increase its influence in international economic and financial organizations.",""],[1,"57","4","Regional and Sub-regional Cooperation Expansion","China should use the APEC as well as other international or sub-regional cooperation mechanisms and enhance regional cooperation with other countries and regions.",""],[1,"57","4","South-South Cooperation Enhancement","South-South cooperation should be enhanced.",""],[1,"57","4","Foreign Aid Structure Optimization","The Chinese foreign aid structure should be optimized and the number of projects in the field of people's livelihood and welfare in the developing countries should be increased.",""],[1,"57","4","Economic and Technology Assistance to Public Utilities and Capacity Building","Finally, economic and technology assistance to social public utilities, self- development capacity building and the other areas in developing countries should be increased.",""]],"113":[[1,"59","9","Support for Special Administrative Region Governance Under Basic Law","Continue to strictly adhere to the principles of \"one country ,two systems\", \"Hong Kong people ruling Hong Kong\", \"Macao people governing Macao\" and the policy of high political autonomy.",""]],"114":[[1,"51","11","Equal Market Access and Legal Protection Reform","create an institutional environment under which economic entities under all forms of ownership use factors of production equally in accordance with the law, engage in fair competition in the market, and enjoy equal legal protection.",""],[1,"51","18","Private Capital Market Access Liberalization","Support and guide private capital to enter the industries and sectors that are not forbidden by laws and regulations.",""]]}});